{"media_id": 3778857778556002510, "shortcode": "DRxMyDbjWDO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRxMyDbjWDO/", "taken_at": "2025-12-02T17:03:49", "caption": "A noise all latte art fears", "owner_username": "providedcoffee", "owner_id": "4293390788", "likes": 3368, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DRxMyDbjWDO\\DRxMyDbjWDO_20251202_170349.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18047638823452282, "text": "Gonna send this to some of my coworkers", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:23:39", "owner": "msnrllns", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18099219280766602, "text": "Goated baristas comment more things people should know idk", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:13:43", "owner": "providedcoffee", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18197227033325253, "text": "Barista tip: if you order a hot latte with almond milk. Don’t do it.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:19:02", "owner": "_joyself_", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18050809805380322, "text": "Accurate ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:37:55", "owner": "synessofactory", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062631980199913, "text": "Here’s some more thoughts: \nOne thing that is rarely taught on steaming is how much the milk will tell you what it wants. This is why alternative milks usually are hardest to un-screech… they need a ton of air. You want to have the Steam wand in a position just off center with enough room to start a whirlpool, have the steam wand just underneath the milk to start the whirlpool and then add air. slowly incorporate all your air before it gets hot, also to keep the spin. If you are steaming and it starts making any of these sounds check on the position or amount of air in the milk, it may need adjustment. Happy pouring!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:09:33", "owner": "providedcoffee", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17914782078249190, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:10:59", "owner": "nathanlaterre", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17869966305405307, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:53:28", "owner": "brainrutt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080259647131398, "text": "I love when my boss lectures me on something & then makes a reel outta it 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:54:08", "owner": "sambodyoncetoldme", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18417425002184746, "text": "Delete this. I’m scared that our rude regulars will find out I’ve been purposefully burning their milk.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:05:53", "owner": "paigedayl", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17977336826794720, "text": "😍👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:17:37", "owner": "maheshbadu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103935187597275, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:24:32", "owner": "msnrllns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105536350644954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:23:58", "owner": "msnrllns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952471708028318, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:24:07", "owner": "msnrllns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092106566497327, "text": "I’m pro milk screecher, it’s like asmr for the whole shop", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:40:53", "owner": "angelina.ngy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18101611381685466, "text": "So, which one better?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:56:16", "owner": "ravlearr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117860824564597, "text": "Interesting 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:32:18", "owner": "ninagarcia0804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926702020034543, "text": "@felledplume take notes bruh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:24:22", "owner": "msnrllns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064083206450583, "text": "Milk Asmr Mhmhmhmhm", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:41:38", "owner": "der_waffelier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090834859746566, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:39:50", "owner": "ardn.3c", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3769333633221128832, "shortcode": "DRPXPf4E_KA", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRPXPf4E_KA/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T13:40:41", "caption": "破解iPhone功能！\n\n#iPhone17 #iPhone17Pro #iPhoneAir", "owner_username": "imcck_tech", "owner_id": "60579071658", "likes": 14024, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0002_DRPXPf4E_KA\\DRPXPf4E_KA_20251119_134041.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18133901413474356, "text": "misaka26", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:54:23", "owner": "offline_tea_", "likes": 179}, {"id": 18057569537284860, "text": "如果是i12的話 \n應該用沒多久就燒起來了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:11:56", "owner": "qq_hair__o_o", "likes": 359}, {"id": 18076542326225636, "text": "iPhone 11 Pro Max 可以用嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:45:17", "owner": "ryanlin1031218", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987539628911811, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:50:22", "owner": "k021385", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087504658988479, "text": "現在沒錢換17，還是別拿手上唯一的12冒險😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:33:48", "owner": "a98xt", "likes": 101}, {"id": 17904777666275850, "text": "在這麼小的螢幕用分屏是不實際的，所以蘋果不給這功能，眾安卓廠：？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:41:07", "owner": "ivanlo0725_ttp_fan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18095267266798728, "text": "他是把iPadOS灌到iPhone裡面", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:04:00", "owner": "avery11111102", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17953897884017586, "text": "🙌求教程", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:32:14", "owner": "haoyu_4444", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18186096040340762, "text": "🙌🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:03:53", "owner": "clabe_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049041080393330, "text": "求教程", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:16:19", "owner": "max_1.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096650203865158, "text": "安卓機一早已經有分屏功能好實用, iPhone 要破解已經落後了！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:23:27", "owner": "tsederrick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18524761702067492, "text": "我想要分屏功能", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:21:48", "owner": "ycbrphotography", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18108895300623256, "text": "平板有啊", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:44:22", "owner": "cai.0824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081396193892252, "text": "變平板了吧？", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:39:30", "owner": "_ac.610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973350825804419, "text": "有教學嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:02:28", "owner": "xuyanxixu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082096889117968, "text": "🙌求教程", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:03:45", "owner": "wateryan44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851434660553900, "text": "14可以用嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:43:25", "owner": "timlin02031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939320655965027, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:31:39", "owner": "stamywer_.0227", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18399318463121355, "text": "How’s", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:42:49", "owner": "_ga._.cc_5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929267161118105, "text": "跟nugget差不多", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:56:22", "owner": "easonhuang0624", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18499451434073619, "text": "求教程", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:04:02", "owner": "ooz._.fun325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338947921230565, "text": "我需要教程！！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:34:14", "owner": "chi_022113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900340165335103, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:42:30", "owner": "zibai2.555", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18142535140459752, "text": "也只有橫向鎖屏比較實用而已", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:19:57", "owner": "samuel731205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076302317334633, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:58:43", "owner": "dnl_901014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083672399025061, "text": "想知道🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:16:20", "owner": "so__pkq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932705665104862, "text": "有夠可悲。要亂搞iPhone 的話你就去買pixel啊", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:28:54", "owner": "znd73215371", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107449318621468, "text": "How", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:44:32", "owner": "thehanghk", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["iphone17", "iphone17pro", "iphoneair"]},
