18096427870877776, "text": "You have a man's voice 😜", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:51:33", "owner": "dobsalom24", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18020146445788043, "text": "So sweeden is where the women arent obese?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:51:15", "owner": "twofindre", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18538627870006475, "text": "You tell nothing but LIES!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:50:21", "owner": "erlabur919", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18021834950789265, "text": "Explosive mix and athletic genes, very cool", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:47:57", "owner": "pedropablomontesgarcia", "likes": 108}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3745000767385387496, "shortcode": "DP46lsnkkHo", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP46lsnkkHo/", "taken_at": "2025-10-16T23:55:09", "caption": "We are so immature", "owner_username": "thirdwavebbq", "owner_id": "145656883", "likes": 148768, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0004_DP46lsnkkHo\\DP46lsnkkHo_20251016_235509.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17926220061153298, "text": "This reminds me of wawaterworth's grandma. Miss her so much", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:51:07", "owner": "aldehydicisotope", "likes": 1636}, {"id": 17951030241041293, "text": "I was having fun until some guy mentioned it reminds him of his god damn grandma", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:34:26", "owner": "gerennnn133", "likes": 22802}, {"id": 17862002364435823, "text": "Queefy beef.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:41:29", "owner": "derronellies868", "likes": 5330}, {"id": 18086048962816593, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:42:08", "owner": "donny4g6", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18428002054104852, "text": "no tendernism smh 😒😒", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:00:34", "owner": "paigeangelique_xo", "likes": 945}, {"id": 18077222128968398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:03:34", "owner": "capnhorse", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18207512905311677, "text": "I was having a good time until someone said “I was having fun until some guy mentioned it remindes him of his god damn grandma”", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:17:55", "owner": "johnie_quantavius_mcdingleton", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18120141478518676, "text": "She’s defiantly queefs when he pulls his meat out", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:14:23", "owner": "fatm00seknuckle", "likes": 144}, {"id": 18109088527593932, "text": "This is the content boys want to see", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:04:12", "owner": "jdubya_md", "likes": 291}, {"id": 17930069952132530, "text": "Is that surrounded by Mac n cheese?? 😮‍💨🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:57:10", "owner": "_crissycoffinsandcoffee_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086139089509351, "text": "How y'all roasted thor's hammer? I'm shocked", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:05:50", "owner": "the_comedic_1", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18045003437398619, "text": "I should call her", "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:08:45", "owner": "life_of_me666", "likes": 553}, {"id": 17848790766553778, "text": "Beef que…", "created_at": "2025-10-21T00:12:57", "owner": "castiron_kyle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17885625978390977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:53:38", "owner": "stephane_ultimason", "likes": 100}, {"id": 17904110916294101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:22:43", "owner": "the_wind_41", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092471527850624, "text": "Hold up Mjolnir !?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:46:08", "owner": "_vortexb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18030446525720979, "text": "Shit wasn't that funny tho", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:48:38", "owner": "ks2calivalley", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18098145397700499, "text": "Not Tendernism??? 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:05:28", "owner": "fidelsofunny", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054165434292293, "text": "The sound came from the base of the meat separating from the Mac and cheese not the the bone in the hole. The reference is invalid.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:18:24", "owner": "crazy8forlife", "likes": 199}, {"id": 17894249130357910, "text": "She is worthy", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:15:56", "owner": "paul_the_plumber", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18360598783084218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:18:13", "owner": "kisoextra", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18540781813006843, "text": "I was waiting for some tendernism 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:53:33", "owner": "jetlifedela", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106610053621406, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:16:45", "owner": "huntzinc", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18140387662453951, "text": "Thats great and all but WHERE CAN J GET THIS MEAT PLATTER 🍖 OMGGGG", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:39:04", "owner": "ch33tah_boy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 185029