ight too since a queef is just air being forced out of a pocket", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:25:58", "owner": "t1tling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076805921244746, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:54:26", "owner": "cinnamonbhabie23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043657271495431, "text": "Queef Latifa", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:53:37", "owner": "dkearth82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995636433719557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:54:53", "owner": "lakshayk_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904211392162287, "text": "It reminds me Thor's hammer", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:04:05", "owner": "luigibisciotti_969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007106570819370, "text": "I think you meant to say beef queef…", "created_at": "2025-12-15T03:43:06", "owner": "shellsmock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069074021616098, "text": "Beautiful.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T00:07:53", "owner": "shinobi_hannya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953237920026630, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-14T20:18:24", "owner": "eatsenchantment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059239271295562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:33:18", "owner": "hey_its_thei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985824771761547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:10:53", "owner": "neither.nowhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959614753033580, "text": "Spit on it", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:14:35", "owner": "itzadam_5th.accc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865912405518910, "text": "OK, but what are they eating? That looks so good.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:20:33", "owner": "angelica.s_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062141816634696, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:00:11", "owner": "stormyweather0429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547775044033914, "text": "Im exposing religious organizations connections to government permitting violation of laws and rights. While not only manipulating congregants violating privacy and intimidating come to you saying prophecy and Gods will. They use chemical warfare and airborne toxins to harm individuals having harmed innocents and more covering up murders with health issues im being stalked harrassed defamation and government permitting i also have evidence on a polotical leaders murder they covered up through a magazine and are human trafficking by isolating people from there families check my instagram @johnm3_1 and warn others please", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:04:00", "owner": "predestined3_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066544976396766, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:07:31", "owner": "gustaf_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082629740158786, "text": "Tryna be thor by any means possible 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:43:23", "owner": "neeuqnil_adedn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872273704468741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:08:38", "owner": "the_multiverse_of_yugioh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940457932098250, "text": "MEEF", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:58:49", "owner": "bradwitha.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436415728099929, "text": "That thing sounded like it was there for over 12 years😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:18:39", "owner": "kledjan_lico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927709990033261, "text": "Thors hammer", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:27:30", "owner": "cros_sberry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368879731094429, "text": "Why does this look soo AI like??", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:05:48", "owner": "__.rexy._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091252352501483, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:41:48", "owner": "lerue.jer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096778456836281, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:45:43", "owner": "mateo_onthemove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110240410720858, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:07:04", "owner": "cebel2301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857267836565451, "text": "💸He💸 he 💸he 💸he💸 he 💸", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:53:55", "owner": "tlor._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094826803807684, "text": "Damn that shit look exceptional.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:17:38", "owner": "eburns_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857344354568753, "text": "Isn't every queef.. a meat queef?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:37:53", "owner": "owe.w.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080267522147610, "text": "Meatjolnier", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:40:23", "owner": "dvkjoe83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046532150469398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:18:50", "owner": "_xeudo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914674918248626, "text": "That's what she said 😂 I knew I stirred the pot right, it got to flowing like a lil lava cake", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:20:03", "owner": "sincerleebeau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18563947003032587, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:24:25", "owner": "raindrifter93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083580137471254, "text": "My meat queefs too 🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:23:21", "owner": "n0d0n0xy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866345053435010, "text": "Beef queef 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:08:23", "owner": "baldandbullyrescue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078541591957662, "text": "No tendernism!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:11:43", "owner": "karoogah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948460494932462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:09:46", "owner": "ti11d3athcallmynam3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918993940223653, "text": "RIP wawaterworth Grandma. Would love to hear her again 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:17:46", "owner": "dap3danny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988976100744356, "text": "this reminds me of @aldhydicisotope 's reminder of wawaterworth's reminder of his grandma", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:46:38", "owner": "kendo_da_don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858835126559766, "text": "I mean, it's always from meat", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:07:57", "owner": "ashkan.rostami.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000396575834321, "text": "When it first slides out your butt stuck from a deep fudgy creampie", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:01:28", "owner": "nunyabiz20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153549463414428, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:48:41", "owner": "monna_m0nna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096829900866503, "text": "Yeah real funny 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:20:29", "owner": "sosvn7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086585569955086, "text": "Me after the gym when I go shower", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:09:08", "owner": "alfie.gungun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944218123073375, "text": "The road warrior", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:53:05", "owner": "el_kabong0907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032383457754745, "text": "What's the difference between a refrigerator and your Mrs.?\n\nThe refrigerator doesn't queef when you pull your meat out. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:59:50", "owner": "armchairoutdoorsman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057734246311660, "text": "With great power comes great responsibility", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:22:14", "owner": "speev.es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914160766095948, "text": "What’s so funny??", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:40:26", "owner": "anthonyatanasio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941216728089398, "text": "@lynseydblackshaw", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:16:08", "owner": "blackshawliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397400776131072, "text": "oh okay", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:28:32", "owner": "hani.bunny__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395340676123853, "text": "So were all reading the grandma comment", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:10:22", "owner": "stephavahair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115066810505086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:52:21", "owner": "rick.nick808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542326714035306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:48:00", "owner": "darkyxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002643914832122, "text": "Jesus loves you and me to", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:34:08", "owner": "janiejanie544", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104007310590158, "text": "Best GWAR song", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:57:18", "owner": "caustastic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099612730692355, "text": "#PFartssssssssss❤️😍🔥🥩🔥🥩", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:55:40", "owner": "alextheemillennial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065771210411814, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:22:12", "owner": "kangsskr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001546304685925, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:55:00", "owner": "_.nightborne._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087686351068281, "text": "Haha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:40:21", "owner": "theemilysinner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099267292804547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:14:26", "owner": "kant4keye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320204059169022, "text": "She's just letting you know you're in for a fun time😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:55:50", "owner": "3za_charm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083674721015332, "text": "All i hear is a good snare sample", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:06:46", "owner": "valenwynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429776941129756, "text": "Augh 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:42:09", "owner": "suki.snackz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101220619776703, "text": "Meatjoilnir, you can only eat it if you're worthy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:37:06", "owner": "geeknlonely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076871282224875, "text": "Queefism", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:29:14", "owner": "nehring_richard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135617800477929, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:34:12", "owner": "echoes_of_nevermore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114009859582954, "text": "Meat Queef sounds like a Norwegian heavy metal band", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:35:23", "owner": "dkrizzyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081830977885914, "text": "Thanks not tendernism", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:41", "owner": "kdm_king_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992115066911203, "text": "Pepridge Farms remembers…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:15", "owner": "mikefarley3095", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095107669848640, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:51", "owner": "swishmajorbeats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114141802575734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:38", "owner": "leon.john.5264", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030807743548474, "text": "All that force and the bone didn’t pull right out? In judging and not in a good way.", "created_at": "202