d_at": "2025-10-28T22:06:10", "owner": "ragdoll6800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083383529107636, "text": "Isn’t “meat queef” redundant?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:53:38", "owner": "vaccineschatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906922471123985, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:55:52", "owner": "roman_sacchenkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084112996822823, "text": "Bueef", "created_at": "2025-10-28T08:23:56", "owner": "solarsistemic.arvreun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071948300015141, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:46:36", "owner": "cameron_veeck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962132389003656, "text": "@seanhasjokes bro here's a meal for you big dawg😮", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:17:39", "owner": "3x_pay_jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188352067328365, "text": "🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:03:20", "owner": "d1000w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947426952918604, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:16:09", "owner": "topk.oopa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18530988901002082, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:47:30", "owner": "smokinfallsbbq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955605351878207, "text": "That was the mac and cheese or potato’s, but okay!", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:51:46", "owner": "_blandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122232046459789, "text": "That sounds delicious", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:53:56", "owner": "konartys072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041337149658371, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:45:19", "owner": "christophernoel393", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141777097431730, "text": "Queef La Beefa right there", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:09:58", "owner": "konnorclaborn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849227464553328, "text": "Can she grab my meat like that?", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:55:04", "owner": "mercedesb3nx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096532858698842, "text": "That guilt laughter is real😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:25:02", "owner": "oneone.oneonezero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870766222451034, "text": "Pepenode!", "created_at": "2025-10-26T21:06:43", "owner": "nick.alv81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047182589397184, "text": "The food was then demolished shortly after this video", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:35:52", "owner": "james_tandaric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925931290118054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:14:05", "owner": "alzokio1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917256010196761, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T11:35:37", "owner": "_wolf_0.1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927674863114726, "text": "I feel like that was the plate that made that noise", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:58:42", "owner": "connor_leary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094849006841009, "text": "@jordan_the_stallion8 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:57:35", "owner": "wheelz__92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083721796818607, "text": "How can you call it a meat queef and miss gold….. re-introducing BEEF QUEEF", "created_at": "2025-10-25T22:54:38", "owner": "r.t.c_traceur2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974854851943481, "text": "Thor meal", "created_at": "2025-10-25T18:16:06", "owner": "royalrosewaistbeads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299271181253050, "text": "she loves it", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:40:09", "owner": "ti.mmy9636", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154393711392282, "text": "“I’ll never let go, Jack” 😏", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:59:10", "owner": "_fortizart_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067307570587115, "text": "Looks like thors hammer", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:32:26", "owner": "vickicon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048260051354899, "text": "Aww, she has such a cute laugh. 🤭", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:03:23", "owner": "e.s_815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027803759749879, "text": "How many people are eating from that?", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:22:16", "owner": "daveashleyky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026738912685085, "text": "Firm confident grip. Excellent", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:20:40", "owner": "rich_sheps_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981661623873428, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:56:20", "owner": "dommy85abroad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180850313483