{"media_id": 3790044777346255495, "shortcode": "DSY8aT8jEqH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSY8aT8jEqH/", "taken_at": "2025-12-18T03:35:41", "caption": "wtf is that sound at the end 😭 \n.\n.\n.\n#reforcive #motorcyclemoments #bikerlife #foodies #bikerguy #bikerinteractions #flirtybiker #cutecouple #bikercouple #booktok #bookgirl #usabikers", "owner_username": "reforcive", "owner_id": "73089897543", "likes": 79743, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0009_DSY8aT8jEqH\\DSY8aT8jEqH_20251218_033541.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18103926874674174, "text": "\"Move🗿\"", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:09:00", "owner": "1lemon5", "likes": 13904}, {"id": 17875918305376761, "text": "She’s on mouse & I’m on keyboard 😌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:45:45", "owner": "reforcive", "likes": 5275}, {"id": 18087021137089853, "text": "Once again, may this love find everyone.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T05:45:52", "owner": "ryanb_152", "likes": 6373}, {"id": 18049148774447702, "text": "hey that's a great wife just one suggestion those chicken need a lil longer seems a bit under cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:05:17", "owner": "joseph_realist", "likes": 66}, {"id": 17907650694290435, "text": "I hope 2026 is where you find some love like this.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:58:38", "owner": "charlyhaha1", "likes": 217}, {"id": 18043045946498425, "text": "I need this kind of love", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:29:24", "owner": "mmmmmm.beans", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18404096635193311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:26:24", "owner": "_valio._", "likes": 3975}, {"id": 17971037663826358, "text": "Noice slippers🙌🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:41:27", "owner": "b.m_720", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18122575945544016, "text": "Bro was bamboozled when she sat down", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:49:05", "owner": "itsryancurtis", "likes": 3150}, {"id": 17954487480045503, "text": "To me, this dude is a random man on the Internet, but I'm genuinely happy for him ong.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:09:44", "owner": "debugged_an94", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18316234576223087, "text": "Its like i can almost taste my 9mm", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:09:45", "owner": "mlodybarszcz", "likes": 749}, {"id": 18003689024684525, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:35:51", "owner": "zrichardo_", "likes": 3139}, {"id": 18169010116379351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:40:42", "owner": "mr_gerbal_", "likes": 2103}, {"id": 18078261632230793, "text": "I'm the first like😭😭💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:37:52", "owner": "ty.aaron", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17908937649278818, "text": "Lucky man 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:54:38", "owner": "mohamedb12r", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18088281335067007, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:29:38", "owner": "mail_lenuageux", "likes": 258}, {"id": 18278392519304490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:07:29", "owner": "felidel222", "likes": 229}, {"id": 17854824381592777, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:45:13", "owner": "real.faik999", "likes": 611}, {"id": 18066184043390443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:41:56", "owner": "heumrageahmad", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063036704558654, "text": "Call me Kurt the way I'm boutta Cobain all over myself", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:32:25", "owner": "death_skeleton8", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17906860533293700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:52:35", "owner": "gerardo.dk", "likes": 127}, {"id": 18087636920318260, "text": "Dino slippers", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:00:02", "owner": "comical_brad", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888451381401425, "text": "Waiting for the marriage arc....", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:45:29", "owner": "cyb3rrr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18548803882062452, "text": "Is this too much to ask for", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:11:22", "owner": "general_barkov._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060377225299724, "text": "He ain’t even care about the game he like real life better then the game", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:20:24", "owner": "304shiest", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17951939837918691, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:21:59", "owner": "k3rmit898", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18088715045316689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:50:17", "owner": "santitello56", "likes": 420}, {"id": 18332283217214153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:38:09", "owner": "amar0_0siris", "likes": 77}, {"id": 17842097706667074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:12:13", "owner": "drdragonpp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056244467335429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:10:01", "owner": "vi._.chos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18434186302104861, "text": "I love that guys with 0 tattoos will get a girl absolutely covered 😂😂 screams me and my wife", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:59:48", "owner": "sy7_pb", "likes": 207}, {"id": 17875893114373871, "text": "That aint a boy dinner, thats a man dinner 🗣🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:28:12", "owner": "imcxonn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18408331519191634, "text": "This is awesome", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:40:36", "owner": "billy_the_goat_69", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17943763305093991, "text": "Fym move? Don’t bother him??? There’s plenty of space on the desk, don’t ruin his game 🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:22:05", "owner": "knightmare6907", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928220614032343, "text": "THE SLIPPERS 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:45:45", "owner": "yourstruly_nom", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18092065109495031, "text": "I really struggle to believe any woman on the planet can be with a non masculine man who sits on a chair all day playing video games, I really can’t quite understand it. I realise it probably has a lot to do nature vs nurture, growing up in Scotland, you’re expected to be able to do everything, which leaves no time for playing computer games.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:38:26", "owner": "jayevo1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084127073114934, "text": "Someone liking me like that genuinely doesn't seem like real possibility. Its so over", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:35:10", "owner": "___hynek", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18007115204665484, "text": "Every guy dream", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:44:38", "owner": "viloneg_og", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077055617194075, "text": "Thank your man for asking what the green was, cause I was not figuring it out 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:27:19", "owner": "the_great_lost_one", "likes": 61}, {"id": 17981698286783686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:02:15", "owner": "shrerhs_lmao", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18085626038321934, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:25:26", "owner": "clutchgokuyt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996467214848472, "text": "Sure this is sweet but that dinner looks gross lol", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:13:24", "owner": "michael._.caleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077969735219005, "text": "Without the toes showing, I would not accept this from my girlfriend", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:57:26", "owner": "touchsomegrass24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872031277395329, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:00:49", "owner": "jenusha69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096769252859127, "text": "🧎‍♂️Hey God✝️....its me again. 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:17:11", "owner": "_buff_boi_", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18071333495086440, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:24:46", "owner": "n.77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066113558388602, "text": "is that arc raiders i see😏 @felix.rennie", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:48:50", "owner": "notjac4bs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974457777797069, "text": "nah its all good, ill go home and eat my dinner and play games. BY MYSELF.🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:02:09", "owner": "_weru_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107458795727793, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:07:01", "owner": "bkt.enes.11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049802807437603, "text": "Bros winning", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:41:38", "owner": "n4te_o5", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18166291951389619, "text": "My shotgun is making slugs for