😂😂😂 have fun love birds", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:09:38", "owner": "dakotak20032003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124891225517098, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:05:48", "owner": "venomenal2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438892348100496, "text": "Typical life of an arc raiders player", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:05:17", "owner": "jeffrey99454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091097884754983, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:03:11", "owner": "fromscratcheu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070515626378197, "text": "What do you have on your feet bro", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:02:46", "owner": "etagi_yochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091054213938493, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:58:11", "owner": "soggysockboi58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069705926104810, "text": "Holy fuck, this is a nightmare existence.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:57:31", "owner": "figffssma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090138596301535, "text": "This just reminds me how lonely I am😢", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:54:55", "owner": "chaosonpawz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063356654234218, "text": "yeah i would have gave that bih to the dog no cap 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:53:32", "owner": "shhrudy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842710528658574, "text": "this is like watching tv static. I can’t comprehend what’s happening on my screen.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:52:32", "owner": "joshua.aalbers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999583188842042, "text": "There was so much room why put it directly where his mouse is?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:52:04", "owner": "ait6usa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983029503927700, "text": "Some men in this world die of thirst while others drown", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:51:04", "owner": "qtipp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400781560124101, "text": "Gahhhhhh dayummmmmmmmm", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:51:02", "owner": "editz_nmox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078500978227154, "text": "Is she single?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:50:55", "owner": "mercedes_t80_offical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073975772347007, "text": "Algún día...", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:47:35", "owner": "_samknt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089544215058007, "text": "I ain’t even seen the girl and I know she fine af", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:39:45", "owner": "mitchellthorntonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193553638326514, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:29:53", "owner": "fyikozy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869989783486798, "text": "Damn I just got hungry, should I do gauge 12 or a .357?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:29:32", "owner": "darienxeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890284396261618, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:28:22", "owner": "jhrenji137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080751064925864, "text": "3rd wheeling on my phone is crazy😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:27:14", "owner": "bored_in_black", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077347946213157, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:26:22", "owner": "greatqueentori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067258133394423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:24:52", "owner": "dyn_030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066580280531915, "text": "I cracked the code. She does this to get him off the game", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:24:29", "owner": "colegabeats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098296183861823, "text": "I was gonna say “how come he gets a 10\\10 but I can’t” but I realized type shit I respect the work", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:23:15", "owner": "15_gorrilas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082493222142628, "text": "that's all I want", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:20:52", "owner": "disggusting_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095196163918978, "text": "Am I ducking interrupting you bro", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:20:01", "owner": "csrv.psd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088428073972713, "text": "God had his favourites  and clearly im not one of em", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:19:42", "owner": "misstea157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934613086113705, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:17:57", "owner": "kobe_van_aart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932834788179009, "tex