7, "text": "Never", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:51:50", "owner": "muffinvinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070214069096799, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:47:59", "owner": "el_falco_verde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079268858337042, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:44:58", "owner": "a7x_ryzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549700837054252, "text": "The best wife ever", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:44:51", "owner": "cryptic_1anonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068728313454256, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:43:42", "owner": "chinothamenac33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546677803030933, "text": "i swear he had this thought for a second: \"well what the hell i am free loadout anyways\" lol", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:42:44", "owner": "djjentleman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956220172022749, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:41:27", "owner": "ap3x_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968465964994756, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:40:56", "owner": "keymaner12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915457696357232, "text": "Me in the future with somebody’s son💗", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:38:09", "owner": "tonykamado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063305627232947, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:36:26", "owner": "tydrowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075794279258425, "text": "\"hey stinky ☺️\" \"MOVE🗿\"", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:35:57", "owner": "nacho_10_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845780218626182, "text": "when", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:30:19", "owner": "occultist_anonymous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107968417713983, "text": "i’m sorry twin but ts a humiliation ritual", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:30:13", "owner": "matthew.eastman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498794815075782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:30:06", "owner": "_lone_wofl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025282622595335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:26:31", "owner": "apenas_miguel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369622552086856, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:25:11", "owner": "polo.r.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077669096241807, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:23:55", "owner": "zawggert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946953514074382, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:23:23", "owner": "gabraltar1sg0at3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081555794163931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:23:13", "owner": "sexar_ito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116009170599634, "text": "The goat of fps arc raiders", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:21:17", "owner": "nohe_the_goat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122834023536445, "text": "f**k my life", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:19:58", "owner": "teased", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552826975058299, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:19:40", "owner": "aidsinfestedurinal", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103517341667313, "text": "When I kill myself this reel will flash before my fading vision", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:19:21", "owner": "dr_w777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989929335858372, "text": "I'm lonely", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:17:54", "owner": "ghost1man47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872020555394679, "text": "He was lowkey stressing after until he realized you js made him a feast 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:16:42", "owner": "arxchn1d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085027907021599, "text": "Give me rice", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:15:47", "owner": "re.di_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854183848547948, "text": "I could not have a girl do this or that seat would be uncomfortable for her thigh (iykyk)", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:14:18", "owner": "l1nkarts1232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092990629909481, "text": "this is all i want for Christmas", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:13:32", "owner": "gavin9825_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137382763473905, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:10:16", "owner": "dzy_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072317879593244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:09:58", "owner": "dzy_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080822647913867, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:09:12", "owner": "shesbeinfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079576484178701, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:09:05", "owner": "sadicartier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954310777042502, "text": "Uncraiders 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:08:46", "owner": "robert9564u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933550711134786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:08:24", "owner": "imss.mp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002168831692064, "text": "Just realized we alone and smiling at ts is sad", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:07:28", "owner": "rugs_r_rad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088494679822047, "text": "great i wanna jump off a bridge now", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:03:19", "owner": "myusher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045490862702694, "text": "May God protect you from my envy", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:02:30", "owner": "jotan_te", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129336745448253, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:02:13", "owner": "edwing.mata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903772513323305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:02:05", "owner": "thunter__03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081706520142781, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:57:52", "owner": "thats.k0rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000384401698943, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:57:05", "owner": "_bhadrachua_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989046456880521, "text": "Just by seeing her wears a hat I know he stinks.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:56:57", "owner": "doctor_fate285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064780934194951, "text": "My life if I lock in", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:54:43", "owner": "gohanabanana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375310447156433, "text": "I see what good is doing for other people…", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:52:21", "owner": "mpetricioli_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971514066824855, "text": "One day...", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:48:05", "owner": "j.x.u.n0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077421254244862, "text": "Bro wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:45:19", "owner": "erdodemirov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387498646182242, "text": "Yo que mierda estoy haciendo mal en mi vida ?", "created