41", "owner": "ngawang8563", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888828709399859, "text": "666", "created_at": "2025-12-17T09:36:41", "owner": "eatredbeans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085485403842875, "text": "这种我都不收", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:02:38", "owner": "see2001__huge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096429715852018, "text": "05女大求一个固搭子_", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:57:56", "owner": "chipm6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088751401986772, "text": "想被宠幸", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:25:12", "owner": "xiaoyazi260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892700896381303, "text": "有没有想要被调的妹妹？", "created_at": "2025-12-16T06:23:03", "owner": "chingching9166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132470500501071, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:57:59", "owner": "donnyherman2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972770616968018, "text": "有线下见面约的吗？找个弟弟陪姐姐玩几天，无门槛也不裸聊，口嗨勿扰", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:22:50", "owner": "shan.yanlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851707570563386, "text": "有没有大陆的人呀", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:56:31", "owner": "zx332.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379174579147289, "text": "找个哥哥，长期的，口嗨的勿扰。", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:51:56", "owner": "xiaoxin25181", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146505370445479, "text": "有没有女s", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:48:57", "owner": "_shenshen_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872080765470767, "text": "Cómo llegué aqui? No es vato? Tengo muchas preguntas y todas las respuestas están en otro idioma", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:32:43", "owner": "bad_nimvus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070070288422275, "text": "哥哥来一对一👀白🐯", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:14:12", "owner": "iiikm621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074796920027435, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:14:08", "owner": "iiikm621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080569858897859, "text": "想干啊", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:32:38", "owner": "celestial.palace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926956891174777, "text": "私信有驚喜", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:16:07", "owner": "nbujiguijbuyfgvuig214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869948722479139, "text": "这是什么系列呀😍😍😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:30:47", "owner": "dkgktkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105281845648560, "text": "自己偷偷看：https://t.me/CJSSWNS", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:14:20", "owner": "haibuyuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095452579702195, "text": "哥哥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:55:36", "owner": "llltttfirst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084632293844956, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:23:23", "owner": "luca_740823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948918114932671, "text": "@kkk_12336 你什麼時候結婚沒發帖子給我", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:55:47", "owner": "u_01.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337624774227212, "text": "@_kiki_0223 乖乖", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:30:58", "owner": "djcsn123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061647257235947, "text": "口罩？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:02:46", "owner": "sandiexsyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061580123630887, "text": "自己偷偷看，想看什么在万能搜里搜什么: https://t.me/CJSSWNS", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:10:57", "owner": "ccc.minini2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878629069437880, "text": "@?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:58:40", "owner": "m_valli_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874581487372577, "text": "😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:47:22", "owner": "bayani98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548039161040257, "text": "😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:40:27", "owner": "bayani98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916683376231443, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:08:32", "owner": "hklikes_com", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208718887313988, "text": "哇可以可以我也要一個", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:35:34", "owner": "huanglianbi4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955152079018238, "text": "宝宝来看紫薇❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:05:10", "owner": "youousuansuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026210135587895, "text": "It seems that nowadays it's more important for women to dress provocatively; it's considered acceptable. But if a woman dresses elegantly, they say it's for older people. It's just the opinion of lustful people, because they prefer to see a woman almost naked. For them, that's acceptable. But for me, a woman who dresses elegantly means she has good taste in fine clothes. We live in a very different reality than before, when dressing well was considered acceptable and women had a distinct kind of beauty, unlike today, when all women are the same. This isn't a criticism, just an opinion.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:19", "owner": "adriel_benja_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968628195988944, "text": "It's not that it's bad, but I can't... I think you should get closer to Jesus Christ He sacrificed Himself for the sins of all humanity, for me, for you, for the whole world. It's wrong not to value what He did for all of us. I think it's a little disheartening what we do by not getting closer to Him. Because when He comes, then we'll all believe in Him, and that's wrong because when we had the chance, we didn't take it. It's not a criticism, just an opinion or maybe I can't give an opinion.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:17", "owner": "adriel_benja_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068999219078762, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:24:27", "owner": "marta.sofia.7140497", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107424556714964, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:00:27", "owner": "zav_vitaliy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331670383209711, "text": "卖的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:59:49", "owner": "cxcvldash330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867729868488854, "text": "点赞给主人看🐻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:21:09", "owner": "nuomituanzi396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086626708816814, "text": "想要女 s 姐姐", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:02", "owner": "cl.oud4689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104327455639620, "text": "有没有哥哥喜欢小白虎！❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:43:04", "owner": "uu27510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136571206417921, "text": "😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:24:47", "owner": "pallab_halder_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931312144122893, "text": "来个妹子", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:17:02", "owner": "liujie5002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095307973882364, "text": "點贊玩私密", "created_at": "2025-11-24T1