{"media_id": 3789722144956277006, "shortcode": "DSXzDZHjOEO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSXzDZHjOEO/", "taken_at": "2025-12-17T16:48:37", "caption": "Send help 🤣 #rottweiler #pets #dogs #viral", "owner_username": "dycederottweiler", "owner_id": "45640921416", "likes": 328278, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_DSXzDZHjOEO\\DSXzDZHjOEO_20251217_164837.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18148001869443009, "text": "Thats stretch haha", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:08:54", "owner": "lisamarieleu", "likes": 1720}, {"id": 18076561577263702, "text": "\"what's that weird thing attacking mommy's legs?! I must protect her!!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:18:20", "owner": "happytraveller_1", "likes": 6923}, {"id": 17843430414656938, "text": "What do you actually do at that point 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:41:49", "owner": "sean______2002", "likes": 1096}, {"id": 18044380367687388, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:26:47", "owner": "abc13957", "likes": 6925}, {"id": 18294906568277077, "text": "Privacy means nothing at this point 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:01:04", "owner": "calebjordanwong", "likes": 21608}, {"id": 18130896961499827, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:05:01", "owner": "huang.louie", "likes": 971}, {"id": 18144363316403158, "text": "Their choice of timing is hysterical 🤣 ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:08:07", "owner": "anneg_11", "likes": 412}, {"id": 18438975514103357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:18:18", "owner": "corentinminaire", "likes": 1233}, {"id": 18076026866250090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:09:11", "owner": "mpatrick87", "likes": 32677}, {"id": 18340883122224821, "text": "may 2026 give me the strength this thong has", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:57:31", "owner": "linus_hologram", "likes": 427}, {"id": 18382536604144170, "text": "He was defending you from your underwear 🩲 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:07:45", "owner": "flavia_atlante", "likes": 2515}, {"id": 17901875508343117, "text": "I was waiting for him to let go and them to snap back on your legs with a *Thwack*😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:20:32", "owner": "esskay27", "likes": 749}, {"id": 18007777115667913, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T19:31:18", "owner": "nba_biggdraco", "likes": 6827}, {"id": 17878305234353675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:51:24", "owner": "_reiwa_gannen_", "likes": 421}, {"id": 18498728386073677, "text": "🤣🔥 I love this inside POV!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T07:29:56", "owner": "trisarahtops.jacobsen", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18190758892339989, "text": "Smells good 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:11:56", "owner": "robielikesit", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18382395526144963, "text": "“Oooh vis, lekker”", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:50:19", "owner": "daveyboudewijn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051771203663386, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:44:48", "owner": "_hassan_10_m", "likes": 439}, {"id": 18052717616378542, "text": "Es mi reencarnación !! 🤣🤣🤣🤣 Saludos desde Argentina", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:00:02", "owner": "piojero85", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18306450946256157, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T00:36:29", "owner": "renzy_baakel", "likes": 889}, {"id": 18070411790377063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:42:22", "owner": "bda_a1ex", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18050689427414152, "text": "Heeeeeeeeeellllllllllllllll noooooo", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:10:15", "owner": "mystina.vip", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924720622049245, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:42:12", "owner": "mirojz7", "likes": 76}, {"id": 18025685507786551, "text": "That’s the most they’ve been stretched out🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:43:38", "owner": "jbg84__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859316707560906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:18:30", "owner": "martin_w2011", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089202583801959, "text": "Best add for this thong brand 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:44:15", "owner": "illyaade", "likes": 12372}, {"id": 18076526333205466, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T20:20:19", "owner": "lfondo_food", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090261151946843, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:31:20", "owner": "umut.taslakk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084827768101651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:00:52", "owner": "kawai_polat", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18071539682370764, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:49:27", "owner": "samicekk.5678", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862091923551772, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:29:12", "owner": "avnish_.chaudhary._", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18384888148144376, "text": "قد لمعت عيناه بالعزم انتفضت يمناه \nفي هدوء الليل😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:39:59", "owner": "3zedin_200", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100653220768642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:41:36", "owner": "1p_wt", "likes": 171}, {"id": 18049468238423977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:28:09", "owner": "fauzanmus5", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17853992304547002, "text": "That’s why in the woods, walking your dog and you get desperate, you could do a little tinkle with them there and feel no way about it 😂😮😢🤣😵‍💫🫢😬", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:25:29", "owner": "keticha67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085133737858677, "text": "Just give em to him, they’re destroyed! 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:01:08", "owner": "lilith.thedragon", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18137417584421963, "text": "Rottweilers are top five cutest dogs ever.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:20:07", "owner": "heidyheller", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17955577428047077, "text": "The intense eye contact -- it's like he is asserting dominance or impatience or something", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:52:49", "owner": "lifeshouldbegood", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18115321738514059, "text": "Who won? 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:09:52", "owner": "cmj.s", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18160745104397060, "text": "Auauau🐶🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:00:16", "owner": "andrewmessias7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919296493209592, "text": "ok this is getting a little bit out of hand", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:21:54", "owner": "wybredny.okularnik", "likes": 179}, {"id": 18389087200182505, "text": "Can someone tell me why dogs always want to be in the bathroom with you or even just an animal?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:36:40", "owner": "nattrosse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050312624408822, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:55:43", "owner": "ten.jachym_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18027840914584889, "text": "The stretch just meant they once did fit😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:08:42", "owner": "marijuannaimysystem", "likes": 105}, {"id": 18073555019580005, "text": "You didn’t think to close the bathroom door with your pets in the house what if your mom walked by seeing that ?? 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:21:16", "owner": "ikiru_no_konran24.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106551124645159, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:20:39", "owner": "sagar821901", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18550833640010573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:06:27", "owner": "aryan_rahimi66", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059757914310527, "text": "Havhavhav", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:53:13", "owner": "zreaxyzq69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049959206437054, "text": "Dame mi... Mi pollito de desayuno o... Te la suelto desde acá y va a doler 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:40:50", "owner": "escritora.anitabenitez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910525417128066, "text": "bro knows what hes doing", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:53:01", "owner": "abdu.halis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18191660719338174, "text": "@the.unserious.guy , nahi🫵🏼🐕", "created_at": "2025-12-19T17:13:23", "owner": "utkarsh_who00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867284911512698, "text": "He is taking you for a walk today 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:20:02", "owner": "aleksandra_skubis", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17886968163284071, "text": "Eu na primeira vez", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:32:23", "owner": "sadzin_kkj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051619148676327, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:33:34", "owner": "trackhawk771", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138101281421603, "text": "Y did u let the door open🙄", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:44:11", "owner": "miss_immature_21", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17866705278521033, "text": "My shepherd did this to me more than once then he realized why I’m sitting down like that he never came in again", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:29:04", "owner": "kurogan3_84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064222142205712, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:52:17", "owner": "sullygram77", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17939246928100718, "text": "“Good boy”", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:45:31", "owner": "__big_gio__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033365996543685, "text": "Ur dog indirectly promoting ur panty’s brand!!", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:10:21", "owner": "aadrthur99_depk", "likes": 36}, {"id": 17874317736460695, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:05:17", "owner": "ysr_1v6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924475033186785, "text": "Aayyyooooo lmao @meljesticspa 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:46:23", "owner": "mrjuanc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954430723058447, "text": "What the hell is a door🚪???", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:23:53", "owner": "crazy_boy.1.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053314418343886, "text": "@denisel.__ deur dicht bij het plassen 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:30:10", "owner": "marco.rietveld1964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111126358529580, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:20:15", "owner": "fuckingspamname", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996053337717103, "text": "The dog wanted to try them on mommy let me try them on 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:00:44", "owner": "yokeydragon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064773563630926, "text": "It’s the eye contact for me… 🤨😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T14:48:53", "owner": "ilseeetje_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099362227654236, "text": "Quando dizem que o cachorro pediu link é esse cachorro @alebatistuta @maatheus_rosaa @_vitao_k7", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:25:04", "owner": "ynaelima", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077364494255454, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🐶🐶🐶🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:02:39", "owner": "sonerkurt222", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083347498894278, "text": "@jeffreyvandervinne dit is dezz als die ook de kans krijgt hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:31:35", "owner": "rnijstad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849147601613671, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:16:39", "owner": "hondaguysitka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17843434203642107, "text": "bro let it go,there's no fish in there", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:02:13", "owner": "jassmultani4u", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543783706029976, "text": "Está muy concentrado en la tarea ☝🏻🧐🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:09:28", "owner": "duciel7", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18108035248634116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:10:52", "owner": "daniel739402", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18538598500045449, "text": "Good boy 👏🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T17:10:04", "owner": "radjunge_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18083226463886629, "text": "Clearly gentle parenting isn’t working but the strength of those undies is top notch! 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:59:26", "owner": "ladybugbounce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157995199410221, "text": "Haha! Onze Duitse herder zoekt altijd mijn vrouw haar ondergoed in de wasmand.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:10:39", "owner": "nicovanboxem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380284603158126, "text": "He smells the 🐟", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:40:55", "owner": "luckyluca1999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043421504710435, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:41:37", "owner": "aslanbogarahmi3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063850853201143, "text": "He smelled fish", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:05:58", "owner": "dudas_4ever", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030716174563308, "text": "@jillsmits92 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:03:47", "owner": "nielskrf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050276441680076, "text": "Ti ricordi quando pisciavo ieri a quel cespuglio , ma tu tiravi perché avevi fretta. Ecco come ci si sente stronzo", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:13:24", "owner": "_.imcata._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908695264270931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:40:50", "owner": "ineednofilters", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075338672253843, "text": "Omg I thought my rottie was the only one 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T02:48:24", "owner": "taylordunbar__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034910624720806, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:03:06", "owner": "jenn1f3rzomb13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067126358407228, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:17:02", "owner": "luizinho01412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107466718563339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:15:52", "owner": "blaze.a.wilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877675159449065, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:15:04", "owner": "jao_pedro_1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083367791137060, "text": "Si me muero reencarnó en el perro🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:14:41", "owner": "neymar.ztx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333395137215995, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:12:32", "owner": "t_trw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029801069570524, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:11:36", "owner": "samuelsilvados200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843896680650601, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:10:56", "owner": "xaviii_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085113895867264, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:06:51", "owner": "miodragjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116816287586602, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:06:07", "owner": "drzeus2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038805974721151, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:04:34", "owner": "jame676767", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864064381538266, "text": "El perro sabe cosas", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:03:17", "owner": "manuel_alfonso42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201055525323486, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T23:02:25", "owner": "k.melo_2k25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060076199640992, "text": "Thats not a dog its a dawg🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19