 17926657176179493, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:28:47", "owner": "_.itsmemichelle193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960640752880364, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣😭😭😭😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:26:13", "owner": "eduardoflores4553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084203300111058, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:25:35", "owner": "ekacahyatiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105608002710962, "text": "Usko andar ka darinda jaag gya 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:25:27", "owner": "rushil_aggarwal111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18553693672004628, "text": "Quien pudiera ser perro😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:24:28", "owner": "nomagradalafesta2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871291639474923, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:21:14", "owner": "pine.sa.mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959432367887000, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:20:01", "owner": "r1kos1mb0l0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353071207204625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:18:32", "owner": "_arjuna_shinde_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072208121369104, "text": "Thurki Kutta 🐶🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:18:32", "owner": "mainrajansharma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102530950700997, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:17:51", "owner": "adriaanionita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078324209183265, "text": "Нашёл кота", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:16:09", "owner": "alklimal7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973320885810856, "text": "😂😂😂❤️🐾🐾", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:13:55", "owner": "adriana__la.vida_es.1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989957373911895, "text": "@jadesyt", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:13:14", "owner": "kelcoight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083421146121984, "text": "Skidaj gace hocu rezultate", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:11:00", "owner": "vajditsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100142410744903, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:08:36", "owner": "nrgamer356", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106402645655512, "text": "He says it’s commando day today! 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:05:14", "owner": "hrthune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000232046699421, "text": "he smells the 🐠 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:03:26", "owner": "_alx.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884274871307437, "text": "He’s like let me see that thongggggggg😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:02:48", "owner": "itsjustme.aziza_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068227619423280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T06:02:29", "owner": "13_zeynal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014570777805733, "text": "Can I be your dog?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:58:02", "owner": "kdavvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917348122086527, "text": "Zal nog wel naar pindakaas ruiken", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:53:15", "owner": "the_dutch_hulk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938562708982230, "text": "Bring them to me lol", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:52:32", "owner": "luvhimorhatehim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096657139686695, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:43:27", "owner": "yukzeaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204161137317314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:43:19", "owner": "emre_gr99", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18133996372490728, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:42:00", "owner": "d3kay369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044974319701730, "text": "Reddit is going wild :x", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:41:56", "owner": "sololevelingvampire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079237061464826, "text": "He gonna bring them to me. Good dog 🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:38:42", "owner": "alee.0427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100442623749451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:34:38", "owner": "red_riot_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870524290496240, "text": "Yo quiero ser ese perro😍😍😍😍😍🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:33:41", "owner": "wolf.79095835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318175555222317, "text": "He want to go poop too", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:31:33", "owner": "davey_lee_bleiksloot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035594924526670, "text": "Tirale, lo mando su amo😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:30:44", "owner": "manoloserranomarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125742268518505, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:28:33", "owner": "diogoarguelles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047996744467449, "text": "Kindly choose a better undergarments it's a signal from your dog 🐕", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:27:45", "owner": "my.searchforbeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090511231768816, "text": "😍😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:25:55", "owner": "manuelvoltaje_316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933507610116370, "text": "He said, if I have to hold it till I'm outside in the cold you do too!", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:24:29", "owner": "alanariccix3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993815052888194, "text": "Dycede that's not good brother.... Our dad needs to do it for your mom🐶😂🤭🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:23:43", "owner": "thepawtrio23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067725251144411, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:19:29", "owner": "paweesuda.aa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028935893779939, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:14:51", "owner": "matthias60166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888885745401700, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🤣🤣🤣❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:13:21", "owner": "elgallovelazquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096885112873366, "text": "Bet it stinky in there. No wonder Nate chose chaos!", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:12:55", "owner": "mikebelieve1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127878436505840, "text": "Full commitment stance 😂😂 you’re screwed", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:12:13", "owner": "mjgfvme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305591242252807, "text": "Почему он, а не яя😭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:10:15", "owner": "grigoryapolonof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881418679428158, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:08:19", "owner": "carlos_garaymejia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108401986651100, "text": "he got that dawg in him", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:06:41", "owner": "malte.af", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869323348500349, "text": "E dai alzati devo farla anch'io. 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:04:46", "owner": "sasa6_119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846862207611255, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:04:39", "owner": "gamer.o302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049907150694190, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:03:08", "owner": "caramelrainboww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039670223721539, "text": "Dog needs to teach a man new tricks🤣😏🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:01:45", "owner": "samanthajean.poetry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302073598275341, "text": "I think this boy test her before he want to be naughty again😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:01:16", "owner": "ibrahimyildirim.64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120290008555586, "text": "He's hungry", "created_at": "2025-12-19T05:00:26", "owner": "jon645027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893403658242120, "text": "My name is Nate and I thoroughly enjoyed this", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:58:29", "owner": "taken_while_driving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140846386460473, "text": "Женщина труханы снимай🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:58:18", "owner": "cyopxapax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012414749805773, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:57:48", "owner": "asinghraghuvanshi_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146938420448862, "text": "Damn gonna have xxxxl panty after that 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:56:24", "owner": "magnet11b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080912413900557, "text": "🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:45:59", "owner": "venanagung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116177035506040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:44:53", "owner": "koenigseggzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973906773811974, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:43:15", "owner": "srta.minina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919390483230212, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:39:43", "owner": "deerendivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195462235331265, "text": "Ur voice pitch is reward them and reinforcing this behavior.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:38:14", "owner": "trad3_mrk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046207436686720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:36:51", "owner": "john_white_0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 178868668562