se 🐶😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:10:49", "owner": "apollyoniris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914929111248031, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:09:29", "owner": "stefano.marcelli.96", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079481705236075, "text": "His so pushy 🐶😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:09:04", "owner": "eduloria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054062234678136, "text": "Doesn't look like he needs help, tbh. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:08:56", "owner": "jrush.photos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139243516462855, "text": "MeToo", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:08:40", "owner": "quocybear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066554408407566, "text": "@aleksa.f_ 😂😂🐶🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:07:02", "owner": "mladen_orsi_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107338762567415, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:06:46", "owner": "rodny_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116074909595611, "text": "Lady don't lie... You woke up late and decided to use the bathroom first before taking him out 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:02:39", "owner": "bonez_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087445880070273, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:59:59", "owner": "whyxryee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104637031673350, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:59:22", "owner": "nbs.kris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993206523902040, "text": "Amo tanto los rottweilers 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:54:22", "owner": "ivan_qiu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918917110238044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:50:33", "owner": "qldovqldov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884884744421878, "text": "Did dad train you to do this?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:50:24", "owner": "mitchepoole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391891588195346, "text": "🐶❤️🤣🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:47:22", "owner": "rafi_officialpage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105585817661356, "text": "Learned it from dad", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:46:10", "owner": "sir_kyle_thefirst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911310445123929, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:45:21