ching this 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:25:08", "owner": "alhawy.1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055087433659439, "text": "Man’s best friend 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:24:53", "owner": "jimtroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899836603349178, "text": "Hagne de be 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:24:27", "owner": "mr._saurabh_kharat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145007665450132, "text": "🤣🔥🤣😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:24:13", "owner": "rimes2953", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080610253911931, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:23:49", "owner": "g.july13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075719258016486, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:23:42", "owner": "9mm4real_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931327378139205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:23:07", "owner": "mahe.0907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989883738864205, "text": "He's gotta shit!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:22:05", "owner": "smd71ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958255978038689, "text": "Wedgie", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:22:00", "owner": "diorio_shane21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080829034932058, "text": "Was that thong smells like bone?", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:54", "owner": "ikohans18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010733951652656, "text": "I am same like your dog 😁😎🫵", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:34", "owner": "ivomaric2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063377039208535, "text": "Такій не тощо з унітаза стягне , такій разом із унітазом на двір витягне .", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:33", "owner": "yuriynik72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084335588103749, "text": "Wait till he gets to the middle 🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:30", "owner": "ra.ymond9184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100529551696467, "text": "Dad trained dog 🐶", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:10", "owner": "its_anmol_8022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206745610316156, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:20:04", "owner": "lazare_737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494724538079336, "text": "That's not a Dog,that's playdog monster 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12