", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:29:23", "owner": "claudiutoader1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890826757395388, "text": "He so cute, you can't even be mad at him😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:28:25", "owner": "vasil._.lia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006507698671978, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:25:48", "owner": "lyndonjimeno5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171019909339027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:25:47", "owner": "lukynno92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082630274127421, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:25:39", "owner": "aze_deus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065920253391843, "text": "I think he wants to catapult you! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:24:47", "owner": "kiltsonthecoast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072289931363408, "text": "Thsts a good boy ! who's a good boy !!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:22:45", "owner": "dr_lickalotopuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097565119867695, "text": "😂😂😂😂oh no so mean 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:22:13", "owner": "marinakabus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101891176704709, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:21:56", "owner": "dalerobertsonphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122554168536069, "text": "Do you ever get dragged by your knickers to the park? 🌳 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:21:15", "owner": "i.am.george2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956060211901082, "text": "Hopefully she didn’t use it back again", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:20:56", "owner": "ebagoz2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044912213699739, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:19:43", "owner": "_._._ilona_._._._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091023223767140, "text": "I feel like things may be a little......strained between you 2..... 😂🙌😂🙌😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:19:33", "owner": "amyinutahspups", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18573734911032527, "text": "He wanted some tuna", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:18:32", "owner": "danielhutchinson50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859316707560906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:18:30", "owner": "mar