 "2025-12-18T03:17:40", "owner": "adrinaldo_santiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896220847219654, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:11:29", "owner": "buggytheakita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051226931388391, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:09:59", "owner": "ludovic05001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299049529258202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:08:17", "owner": "david43744e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087320959829551, "text": "Nee 😭😭😭!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:55:37", "owner": "eugenej2022sept", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903070579336284, "text": "I know a lot of people do it, but I still think it’s kind of gross to be sitting there on the toilet holding your phone 🫤", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:55:20", "owner": "lindsayfeathers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019278587799696, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:55:18", "owner": "mrskatez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118879060491233, "text": "He's like I got to shit too come on", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:52:09", "owner": "jdracer9208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843318133648108, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:51:36", "owner": "mrskatez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18443419240098235, "text": "We all feel your pain little dude 🫡🤠", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:49:10", "owner": "foplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909702685274173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:49:03", "owner": "br7yaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166785970386012, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:48:40", "owner": "soybrenda12445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084934325107881, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:48:13", "owner": "kostas.farm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022435100610022, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:45:57", "owner": "leny.vlee2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906159754294848, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:44:45", "owner": "linton__78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956188245901971, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:41:32", "owner": "runtzfrmda718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111629050625706, "text": "If he's stealing, he's wearing", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:37:47", "owner": "snehanshusaini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963183559007603, "text": "Best be careful he could rip you right off that seat lol", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:36:11", "owner": "funnel_cakes2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102425383759369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:35:02", "owner": "elpicudocamaney87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087817366961072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:26:01", "owner": "jay_and_heather", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178603285367935, "text": "Give it up. You're home so get another one😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:23:18", "owner": "laddyd88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065903393411364, "text": "It's very stretchy 😂.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:22:41", "owner": "laddyd88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080070134227014, "text": "At this point you might as well go commando 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:21:55", "owner": "feelingkorny666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875719063372442, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:20:06", "owner": "alice_e_tyson__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355009513204537, "text": "Those underpants lost before the battle began!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:18:15", "owner": "recycledmastiffsmama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096490042854583, "text": "😂🤣..at this point it's a SlingShot!!😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:17:00", "owner": "jtinaleaza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995776302854537, "text": "My dogg knows wussup😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T02:02:04", "owner": "cmaxwell2424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933377386135626, "text": "Bruh really got that dawg in em 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:58:38", "owner": "kunalkk94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061407041268491, "text": "Freaky ahh dog", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:52:04", "owner": "nara.w101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904462867165864, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:51:47", "owner": "ncazi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842611204662547, "text": "Puppy eyes 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:48:29", "owner": "davereed23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947973709077936, "text": "He’s saving her so she doesn’t fall in 😂😂 hero 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:47:05", "owner": "nickbryer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862648351544324, "text": "Say no , with a dngtu tone dont expect bad behaviour to be viewed as bad if you allow it ?", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:43:13", "owner": "dache_harmony_parsons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146795491450717, "text": "Aw, look at his eyes though.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:38:40", "owner": "erbinoutfitters11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126842926517981, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:37:46", "owner": "mrghostyy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085613306042292, "text": "Areee gate toh band kar Pete", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:36:22", "owner": "krishna_khandelwal010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106678300630706, "text": "Boy dog!!😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:17:08", "owner": "dcline20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064386149535016, "text": "Knickers thief 🐶❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:16:46", "owner": "garyh459", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049292936442651, "text": "Lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:14:25", "owner": "_kaleena_marie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089548759793376, "text": "Oh dat is een gevaarlijke, hij weet precies goed zijn puppyface te gebruiken, wst een schatje😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:14:02", "owner": "071monique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193249096328393, "text": "dirty girl", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:07:33", "owner": "cdc22553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843304879642443, "text": "disgusting", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:07:10", "owner": "cdc22553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398134186135294, "text": "gross", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:07:06", "owner": "cdc22553", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867314995432870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:02:29", "owner": "black.orpheus.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013300619642066, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T01:01:54", "owner": "kou.ssai4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180170345036