{"media_id": 3788253467434064224, "shortcode": "DSSlHUljJlg", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSSlHUljJlg/", "taken_at": "2025-12-15T16:11:50", "caption": "We got CASIO SMARTWATCHES before GTA 6… 🤯\n#tech #home #amazon #smartwatch #casio", "owner_username": "thegadgetbadgerr", "owner_id": "66439979879", "likes": 92500, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0015_DSSlHUljJlg\\DSSlHUljJlg_20251215_161150.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18068340578126185, "text": "Check it out using the LINK in my BIO 😮😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:17:24", "owner": "thegadgetbadgerr", "likes": 187}, {"id": 18329262823243664, "text": "How will it gets me heart rate with out the sensor sending light from the bottom cuz the bottom is covered down?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T17:50:48", "owner": "kevgada", "likes": 1803}, {"id": 18063296777444215, "text": "I saw it, you saw it, we all saw it…!! 😈🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:22:43", "owner": "danielgarzonfm", "likes": 1889}, {"id": 18076453850210498, "text": "How in the world does this measure heart rate? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:09:39", "owner": "prayaag001", "likes": 205}, {"id": 18338516251237913, "text": "Very cool, this upgraded Casio would have given Del Griffith a hotel room for the night and covered the mini bar raid.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T19:12:38", "owner": "chipgram480", "likes": 332}, {"id": 17933858310132016, "text": "Ok this is genuinely genius… and yes we all saw the other app too", "created_at": "2025-12-15T16:33:42", "owner": "jacobdevir", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18032891468743447, "text": "Oh wow! 🟨", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:45:40", "owner": "lhistoiredunjohn", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18075029951199231, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:23:44", "owner": "im.sunnus", "likes": 82}, {"id": 18067132520142920, "text": "Yes we saw it", "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:43:37", "owner": "arunbabuthomas", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18067444622531724, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:05:47", "owner": "kop_shei", "likes": 411}, {"id": 18050840684404513, "text": "At first, why would the algorithm show me watch reels 🤔 then I saw the app 😮 oh, okay 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T07:55:43", "owner": "mufi.ooz", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18089269960956657, "text": "Grindr on your phone 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:11:27", "owner": "acuriousgardener", "likes": 147}, {"id": 17874335682462196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:29:22", "owner": "carloshervasmartin", "likes": 2452}, {"id": 17869754877416502, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:33:30", "owner": "_rudra_wrath", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18549408676053103, "text": "Nice. Casio themselves have something like this. I have one", "created_at": "2025-12-16T09:57:53", "owner": "subinpauljoy", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17911128999123506, "text": "Can it run doom?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:52:40", "owner": "mehmet_emin_sevgen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918213865230522, "text": "18 hours is fine for an Apple Watch? 😂 it takes like 30 minutes to charge", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:19:39", "owner": "bustupcentral", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954014506044283, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:19:52", "owner": "bluh_blahx", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18110033890627840, "text": "Gr 😏", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:33:35", "owner": "anuj_thapa2", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17954306106029176, "text": "grinder?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:05:45", "owner": "ikeraiala", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864721147453109, "text": "This is waste actually , Casio already provides a smart version of it at just lower price than olee", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:33:50", "owner": "ed_phil__", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18061035347251126, "text": "finally someone subtly told that wearing casio is ga…", "created_at": "2025-12-16T02:48:54", "owner": "apexfury_", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18079230440219255, "text": "@jakub.ce", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:03:31", "owner": "_polishman_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100911055701108, "text": "LMAO THE GRINDR PIC", "created_at": "2025-12-18T00:13:06", "owner": "icycobaltlive", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071623778076164, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:21:08", "owner": "c4lnoxx", "likes": 142}, {"id": 18033131402753849, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:12:00", "owner": "e.tse_2002", "likes": 157}, {"id": 18072647717365747, "text": "how we do charge the thing", "created_at": "2025-12-16T05:51:09", "owner": "batuhan.alp.arslan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18545257207031312, "text": "@jogindar_98", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:32:48", "owner": "__geeth__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177390454365457, "text": "You can also turn it into a detonator", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:53:52", "owner": "hova_ulysse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955779363897504, "text": "Can it connect with the orange app? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:33:25", "owner": "male2000male", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17883174372423058, "text": "Battery life?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T04:12:58", "owner": "mizanur1068", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904533514167893, "text": "Just get a G-Shock with Bluetooth 🤦🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:13:08", "owner": "z.ege64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995807205714168, "text": "@bikbook_the_real_one_fr @bikartastic_01 @bikbook_the_real_one_fr", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:17:49", "owner": "artistway_70", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003669953836563, "text": "This was why i bought a casio so it wouldnt be a smart watch …", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:47:29", "owner": "adinaaaa__04", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18544516936065295, "text": "can it launch a bomb???", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:00:20", "owner": "francoise_lucie_martin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090892429748781, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:26:47", "owner": "karaki.titan", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18080621072158299, "text": "Bro why grinder", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:16:55", "owner": "hand_of_god_wtf", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17934537710996259, "text": "can i program it to play lingan guli guli", "created_at": "2025-12-19T19:23:51", "owner": "mogsfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095793136899919, "text": "How does it charge?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:23:38", "owner": "dr.gordon_freeman46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987597978913362, "text": "TELL ME IT AUTO SYNCS THE TIME", "created_at": "2025-12-19T18:21:29", "owner": "dhruval_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914989828099094, "text": "Fuck that use Suunto", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:49:24", "owner": "staerckdtd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927542440168401, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T15:55:20", "owner": "aster_ematus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865800676533458, "text": "Does it also work with the Casio Royale (AE-1200)?", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:42:46", "owner": "bigben.1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873323770469049, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:15:03", "owner": "that1frabricator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857713573574991, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:30:41", "owner": "doncoreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995098071722510, "text": "Casio has a smart retro style smart watch. ABL-100W", "created_at": "2025-12-19T09:13:48", "owner": "marius.uldukis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067349423161419, "text": "Bruhhhhhhh 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T03:39:47", "owner": "maaltagabriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071290631084217, "text": "@tedsie_ @fox.ellieee", "created_at": "2025-12-19T00:48:49", "owner": "elsie.dub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891938632387938, "text": "I saw yellow Facebook.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:23:47", "owner": "hawngpanda.lthr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072303491599651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:20:57", "owner": "aguchwck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122843728536255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T20:09:04", "owner": "akshay_nath_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114132361522101, "text": "Brrroooo. I have seen this in the past but it was out of stock 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:55:30", "owner": "olavo.gomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872812126469332, "text": "Personally the \"nothing watch 3 pro\" by cmf is a really good watch too, battery life from 7-9 days depending on \"heavy\"  use", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:47:27", "owner": "jose._.mendoza1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076781180262170, "text": "Lowkey my g-shock has been on the same battery as when I bought the thing 5-6 years ago lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:37:08", "owner": "itsgregcj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076148474261459, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:59:32", "owner": "joeysmith486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858343378570051, "text": "Grindr 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:24:25", "owner": "xahilkoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046598951693045, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-18T12:23:47", "owner": "liquid.circus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036661247753940, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-18T11:21:58", "owner": "josiah_fgs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087972085823794, "text": "How does it count your steps??", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:27:56", "owner": "gurprit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992737641884904, "text": "but isn’t the goal of a casio not to be a cuck to smart watches", "created_at": "2025-12-18T09:56:56", "owner": "igor.designs.systems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003724631829180, "text": "not useful enough \nNEED AI", "created_at": "2025-12-18T08:05:18", "owner": "felipe_de_laurinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893613535369218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T05:53:22", "owner": "jucybalareal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545973448023888, "text": "I saw the yellow pages, 😉 noice 👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-18T04:58:07", "owner": "jacqueslappies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076600454000867, "text": "And you can convert it back to the original form 2 years from now when the app will not work and the project goes under and abandoned 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-12-17T23:16:59", "owner": "pancakespeedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845126218632491, "text": "and if you take a computer from your oven, u can do the exact same", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:52:00", "owner": "teddya91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874362913462686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:27:58", "owner": "dechnically", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136224346473634, "text": "Maybe I bought a Casio to get away from technology, not to count my steps and sell my data to whoever…", "created_at": "2025-12-17T19:41:51", "owner": "memermanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862414621476731, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:51:03", "owner": "swerg72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034394009739791, "text": "No wayyyy", "created_at": "2025-12-17T18:36:48", "owner": "actually_ntb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844006030637030, "text": "@jaracm", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:50:40", "owner": "instadram86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544333822041788, "text": "Will haben 😍, Gruß aus Deutschland", "created_at": "2025-12-17T17:19:16", "owner": "onestone.198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922394311200036, "text": "beautiful, amazing", "created_at": "2025-12-17T16:04:56", "owner": "sandisemesta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001665932692854, "text": "Huawei Watch", "created_at": "2025-12-17T15:05:54", "owner": "doogi.dos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842141605666053, "text": "Why", "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:42:05", "owner": "aqm_zr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908134285279240, "text": "Top or bottom?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T14:11:41", "owner": "strydom_christopher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959722894010420, "text": "Battery goes how long?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:21:02", "owner": "mertas2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066927818426931, "text": "Eu vi uma coisa ali 🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:17:09", "owner": "rafhaas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100042444818290, "text": "Just get a pebble", "created_at": "2025-12-17T13:06:17", "owner": "notmadeof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950422000062948, "text": "You got me at \"BLACKJACK\"", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:25:26", "owner": "gruntingpineapple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972661668978613, "text": "If it doesn’t have a heart rate sensor how does it track your heart rate?…there is a bit(a lot) of a logic flaw in your script for this video", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:50:56", "owner": "mouneesofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918491842218692, "text": "Needs apple/google pay ngl", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:36:13", "owner": "nogoodlor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889262803395514, "text": "my casio is already smart from the box", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:04:14", "owner": "dimitrid972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180232171317816, "text": "Can we cheat in exams ? ,asking for friends", "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:32:48", "owner": "us_senpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071037611079906, "text": "Wepaaaa con grindr", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:44:54", "owner": "fgiuliani51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050315900427482, "text": "With those apps going on you need to track your heart rate 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:19:47", "owner": "bobster13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867836650510947, "text": "You had my attention from right there", "created_at": "2025-12-17T07:37:06", "owner": "priyashsoreng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089292277812523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T07:28:55", "owner": "sopurrplexed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072159209366087, "text": "no thank you i dont want to be tracked", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:46:34", "owner": "_commicat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023358041606146, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:20:27", "owner": "hideki_ryuzaki_31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910352557268311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:03:19", "owner": "antoniorodriguez6154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402364123125371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T05:51:05", "owner": "chooiiyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898742497201552, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T05:15:02", "owner": "alevil76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092580308503834, "text": "BLACKJACK ON MY WATCH", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:51:50", "owner": "_ricky_grover_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093201697901592, "text": "@casiowatches_official se estan viendo lentos en hacerlos de fabrica", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:50:45", "owner": "lord_silva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085821655843884, "text": "this is so cool", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:49:09", "owner": "edmo.51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101804386703741, "text": "Dose it retain the water resistance???", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:48:22", "owner": "dat_boy_in_the_corrner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970153692993687, "text": "i need this shi 😔🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:16:56", "owner": "vantwkss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086463403990647, "text": "Can this help in cheating in exams ?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T04:07:08", "owner": "vatsal_47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052273481378353, "text": "W interaction bait", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:38:20", "owner": "youssefjkaram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956614474023654, "text": "My dream has become truth 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:04:11", "owner": "tunesvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089689910509565, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:01:29", "owner": "han_930121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973257543969008, "text": "Yes but i am Samsung", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:57:02", "owner": "julian_hoyos1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107910289649376, "text": "KKIEEEEE", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:41:30", "owner": "gvto.nv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110709430719624, "text": "What is the battery life?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:25:09", "owner": "rickricardu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070209458527302, "text": "NSA and FBI is watching this", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:23:51", "owner": "carbonara6685", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087517909956458, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:20:09", "owner": "bluecollar_spongebob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090755486499072, "text": "How do i recharge it, and how long is battery life?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:16:57", "owner": "huxter314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087352375998051, "text": "Does it connect to WhatsApp and emails?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T02:06:56", "owner": "chefyuval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069892946106502, "text": "How do you charge it?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:42:23", "owner": "mxvalde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016812155630013, "text": "Disgusting Grinder on his phone 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:25:59", "owner": "grewinson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091052551760058, "text": "🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:06:50", "owner": "dario.lamela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971722581984893, "text": "Welcome back fossil hybrid", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:05:54", "owner": "2ktaxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176972260369217, "text": "Watch how you get pick out from a line in tsa 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T00:50:35", "owner": "idwnt__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148672477436795, "text": "That Grindr icon was total engagement bait, and it looks like it worked perfectly.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T00:42:17", "owner": "tokyodallas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941952714964007, "text": "I love that watch, would never do that to such a master piece", "created_at": "2025-12-17T00:14:52", "owner": "agusmerkado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035800337718437, "text": "does it have notifications?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:23:51", "owner": "yannik_3112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096737716871451, "text": "👀", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:03:23", "owner": "pablon_es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898120576349982, "text": "I’m not taking tech advice from someone who doesn’t know how to wear a microphone", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:02:29", "owner": "andrewtheviking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160567273404623, "text": "But why?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:01:41", "owner": "el.gaudo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930749203154194, "text": "But can you run DooM on it", "created_at": "2025-12-16T23:00:47", "owner": "archricfabrizio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869722648417781, "text": "Not the Grindr 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:59:56", "owner": "atx.sloppyjoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110790835556573, "text": "Did you say blackjack?!!??!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:58:14", "owner": "djnovic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917148559090366, "text": "Do you happen to know if this fits in a Kommando Store Elektronika 55B Melody Watch? I'm pretty sure it's a clone of a clone of the casio😅", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:55:05", "owner": "the_yung_investor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898098811353414, "text": "Grindr 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:55:00", "owner": "marksuiding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050346383416811, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:54:10", "owner": "mosesschou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414969445139179, "text": "I prefer the \"dumb\" CASIO watch 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:28:36", "owner": "carlosguinle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543639028035927, "text": "Q . . . .n", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:27:59", "owner": "neoshot_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065393441186817, "text": ". N", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:27:59", "owner": "neoshot_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094252969902098, "text": "PERFECT", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:14:06", "owner": "ijlj.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851865964562194, "text": "Its a 100$ for a prebuilt watch, like 60$ for the board", "created_at": "2025-12-16T22:02:06", "owner": "namhar_deeas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982626042928695, "text": "I see That you saw what you wanted us to see !", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:56:55", "owner": "slimoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085563584044042, "text": "You had be at blackjack", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:49:04", "owner": "marten_kmpf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041047160717323, "text": "so unnecessary", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:46:13", "owner": "sepehroo777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884545102421304, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:38:34", "owner": "mikeoneill95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374366413153117, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:38:17", "owner": "alantmh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849871318610046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:29:43", "owner": "_my_odd_ootd_collection_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875942701376166, "text": "🙂‍↔️love it", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:05:12", "owner": "monwop__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214304980309569, "text": "Why would I do that?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:56:20", "owner": "chris.burk.maionchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121517506536753, "text": "Did no one else see it ???", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:45:21", "owner": "lost_nd_profound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956213077031233, "text": "How does it do health monitoring without sensors", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:43:37", "owner": "sylkis89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971934648963933, "text": "Does it give you a 12 or 24 hour Chrono?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:43:33", "owner": "nickyxz31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089632093772575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:38:01", "owner": "kubisosus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990790914910839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:32:39", "owner": "un_marika_mal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970181538828656, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:23:10", "owner": "guido.f.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851438089602590, "text": "Um what was that", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:20:46", "owner": "_matt_20_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101497723705237, "text": "Target audience reached", "created_at": "2025-12-16T20:02:18", "owner": "he_is_of_the_fire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401815612132642, "text": "What about the notifications?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:36:38", "owner": "stasiekbudek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098093743864730, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:32:42", "owner": "lukasj0hanss0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127784416512970, "text": "someone explain?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:28:34", "owner": "yinstonchan120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904535881314098, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:24:51", "owner": "portrait_london", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535275538043590, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:19:56", "owner": "joerbear_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114540727606645, "text": "Whats the battery life?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:13:57", "owner": "durbin4299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066632765620405, "text": "does it work with Samsung?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:07:56", "owner": "canned_milktea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039647387711141, "text": "Im defo checking my grindt for you", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:00:58", "owner": "_silasage_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876840748451262, "text": "T", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:00:12", "owner": "ferdinand_roder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025781015589973, "text": "Does it have a timer function?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:49:30", "owner": "coconails_sf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043895954686898, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:44:21", "owner": "whothefuckischrisrowe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988602696871885, "text": "Tag yourself. Im the Grindr app.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:43:32", "owner": "iloveyuwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155558218416440, "text": "Hahahahhahahaha Grindr! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:41:40", "owner": "daniboy4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155905822416581, "text": "@zrliqrm 👀👀🔓", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:38:14", "owner": "chewy_chewing_chew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001734521837391, "text": "Open source?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:28:57", "owner": "ricardoaromerop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080363786137854, "text": "Hmmmmmmmm", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:17:01", "owner": "another_dusky_bloke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072292457376913, "text": "Look! It’s Grindr 🪄✨", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:53:35", "owner": "b0ss__li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102449308742373, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:50:40", "owner": "antoninus.tertius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941896711066904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:49:02", "owner": "vicktor.antonov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991472220857128, "text": "Or i just won’t share my biometrics with anyone, how about that", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:43:25", "owner": "coke_russel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067694399143584, "text": "Now play doom on it", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:43:21", "owner": "_peony_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037073129724490, "text": "All I want from my smart wa