{"media_id": 3783207421892192319, "shortcode": "DSApxsdgWg_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSApxsdgWg_/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T17:05:15", "caption": "🎬 Movie: Scrubs (The clip is from the TV show)\n​Genre: Medical Comedy-Drama\n​Movie Length: 22 minutes (for a typical episode)\n​IMDb Rating: 8.4/10\n​Explanation: This is a clip from the popular TV show Scrubs. It features the character Elliot Reid (Sarah Chalke) in a funny, slightly scandalous moment designed to literally raise a patient's heart rate, playing on the show's signature blend of slapstick comedy, surreal fantasy, and heartfelt medical drama. The scene is quick, visually engaging, and immediately signals the show's tone, making it perfect for catching attention and getting views.\n​Theme: Humorous Healthcare Hijinks & Flirting\n​Hashtags: #Scrubs #ElliotReid #BestNurseEver #Comedy #MedicalShow #TVShows #SarahChalke #FunnyMoments #hospitallifestyle👩🏻‍⚕️🚑🏥💉", "owner_username": "shutup_am", "owner_id": "78047120944", "likes": 324671, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0018_DSApxsdgWg_\\DSApxsdgWg__20251208_170515.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18087303077072487, "text": "The fact the cameraman almost showed us as well lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:49:07", "owner": "typhoon_epic", "likes": 10910}, {"id": 17856342966527561, "text": "But thats a kid and she's an adult", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:46:53", "owner": "crazyvansb6ixxty9", "likes": 1960}, {"id": 17842587693648056, "text": "Hospital address ?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:42:24", "owner": "strawberrysundaeicecream", "likes": 4913}, {"id": 18099719884748280, "text": "That's horrible! Can someone send me the address of that hospital so I can stay away from that location?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:56:02", "owner": "jd.ferg14", "likes": 1416}, {"id": 18089050099982368, "text": "Video pertama berkata, Yes Yes Yes", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:28:52", "owner": "galang.ramadhan13", "likes": 1213}, {"id": 18551852431038393, "text": "No dr or nurse did that for me 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:11:36", "owner": "timothyperkins29", "likes": 1084}, {"id": 17915140848246945, "text": "Movie name???", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:41:50", "owner": "__shoaib.1.0", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18149730853425528, "text": "Stella from How I Met Your Mother?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:44:35", "owner": "kyle.wong.73550", "likes": 145}, {"id": 17846185986601689, "text": "Where can I get her", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:21:44", "owner": "aggiesrnumber1", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18086343014007995, "text": "Nurse in parallel universe 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:11:54", "owner": "real.sahilsheikh", "likes": 297}, {"id": 18100979713701137, "text": "One, she’s a doctor, two yall really need the context of this episode because seeing this out of context is wild 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T23:44:04", "owner": "leebie__", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18089956916498116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T20:04:06", "owner": "sunshine_sahad", "likes": 68}, {"id": 17990164952862747, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:25:15", "owner": "_09ritika_", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17915560743246599, "text": "Now If a guy did something similar to a little girl then it would be a whole turn around in the comment section right now 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T01:49:50", "owner": "d_wnation", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18086551402839556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:41:06", "owner": "guanss66", "likes": 1011}, {"id": 18342972091227994, "text": "Lmfao she didn’t even actually show it that’s the part nobody gets", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:13:14", "owner": "wjyslmy", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17853818532547687, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:34:10", "owner": "temdeden", "likes": 156}, {"id": 18203485165317376, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:41:10", "owner": "garimasingh965", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18106416796653194, "text": "I'm going to that hospital",