f to a minor which makes her a pedo", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:12:36", "owner": "darthsonic.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089516251997004, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:07:19", "owner": "j4l4c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866601259518258, "text": "Awesome 👌", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:04:08", "owner": "chitchatmore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068446100621561, "text": "Smh it be ok for women to commit SA. If she gets caught the male gets the blame for harassment", "created_at": "2025-12-18T23:02:04", "owner": "_jizl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085634222102451, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:59:39", "owner": "alexsandro_20221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089108218802890, "text": "🔥🔥🤣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:59:37", "owner": "alexsandro_20221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987227388870137, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:59:36", "owner": "ashleyking2357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098926867867379, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:57:09", "owner": "dannyeariz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934835455111723, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:56:14", "owner": "jaxbch2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080235035146965, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:47:55", "owner": "raumav_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089060906054023, "text": "Yes 🙌 yes🙌 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:41:41", "owner": "apatheism0013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987082659866680, "text": "Ah yes. Sexual harassment of minors is totally not a gross crime.", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:27:57", "owner": "miles_benjamin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917692891232453, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:18:18", "owner": "m_sako_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094041856915312, "text": "Imagine if the genders were opposite", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:12:23", "owner": "ilay.barr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950196721061100, "text": "She is not the nurse, she is the doctor", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:12:21", "owner": "david.eschmann.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009873695815782, 