ikes": 1}, {"id": 18380648053123219, "text": "Bro F", "created_at": "2025-08-02T17:46:51", "owner": "atajavanmard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18306034489174462, "text": "Good thing you didn't show Osa", "created_at": "2025-07-26T02:39:56", "owner": "warpsfull_10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17856696939472205, "text": "If you’ve ever watched Asian category on the hub you’d know most actually have a bush so Dokkaebi would have more. Also nomad would have the most hair as arabs tend to have more of a bush, and clash wouldn’t have that much, also zofia wouldn’t have no hair, i feel like that goes to iq.", "created_at": "2025-08-01T20:20:19", "owner": "why_did_you_reddem_it", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039643286360189, "text": "Lemme get that valkyrie and frost plz", "created_at": "2025-08-02T03:38:47", "owner": "ivanjrubio", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035314307691795, "text": "Ridiculously accurate", "created_at": "2025-07-19T21:35:33", "owner": "burdick.stepper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009567521789172, "text": "Gridlock.......🌳🌳🌳", "created_at": "2025-08-02T15:58:15", "owner": "jaredxyzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854427433435036, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-19T06:37:40", "owner": "_javier_aj", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17982511316719354, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:55:01", "owner": "daisukebaek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907512691197116, "text": "We are all letting ela abuse us😭", "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:28:07", "owner": "zenit.co.g3n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083860951892859, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-02T06:52:28", "owner": "dave_thegiant98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013499183592757, "text": "Kali?", "created_at": "2025-08-02T07:01:29", "owner": "tbugz_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935794290940618, "text": "@brxndxn1409", "created_at": "2025-08-01T14:35:19", "owner": "hayley_jade161003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059550524340202, "text": "Nah man, this isn’t it", "created_at": "2025-07-18T23:50:51", "owner": "dr.raz224", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18098703436578153, "text": "1000% accurate tbh", "created_at": "2025-07-30T23:17:01", "owner": "dreamzzzbiitch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946147495008430, "text": "Bruh Zofia keep it hairy", "created_at": "2025-07-22T02:48:16", "owner": "caden_woehl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974056767871297, "text": "I have seen many horrors on this app but this is truly something", "created_at": "2025-07-18T20:34:47", "owner": "spenceralbrecht615", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18036460613419185, "text": "Yall sleeping on gridlock😤", "created_at": "2025-07-29T17:46:04", "owner": "papa_sloth_420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929301441963041, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-27T07:40:03", "owner": "veiga.st", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118414417489755, "text": "Mira gets me foaming at the mouth", "created_at": "2025-07-28T11:53:01", "owner": "samnotman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17919986769103222, "text": "Ellas is green", "created_at": "2025-07-24T23:42:15", "owner": "cedieinsta", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060811379464197, "text": "Instagram is asking if I’m interested in this reel", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:55:12", "owner": "mitz_ig", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18055363001119051, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T16:31:54", "owner": "steiner4208_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070628657106904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T08:45:36", "owner": "w_d1az", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063321856982640, "text": "Ash Next and Twitch", "created_at": "2025-07-27T04:32:04", "owner": "deeggan_46", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980350305852540, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-27T00:28:50", "owner": "lucaszommer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101630884566718, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-26T05:24:18", "owner": "erbarone_03", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18012614744775073, "text": "This is disgusting. Where's ying?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T11:38:45", "owner": "candelen.t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122848438485235, "text": "Bro the reel run was going great till this", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:22:14", "owner": "alexx.innit.1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049838015433714, "text": "Zofia pr