060739364587690, "text": "Who did this? Are yall okay?", "created_at": "2025-08-07T07:09:33", "owner": "mathew.grif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862277401449242, "text": "What the actual fuck is wrong with yall", "created_at": "2025-08-07T04:27:31", "owner": "womblez_td", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075445525807306, "text": "What the fuck am I witnessing", "created_at": "2025-08-07T04:06:42", "owner": "lazeraimchick69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897522184269819, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-07T00:54:55", "owner": "ch1cken_jo3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18171542239351450, "text": "Nice 😁", "created_at": "2025-08-07T00:18:10", "owner": "bryan_funzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871475500408960, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:36:37", "owner": "leoniddll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405029155118581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T16:34:58", "owner": "logz_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112844668511250, "text": "Ela for ever", "created_at": "2025-08-06T16:09:19", "owner": "__alire.za__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040700216366664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T15:20:35", "owner": "dumiitrescuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045657698307329, "text": "You should do Buck next", "created_at": "2025-08-06T13:56:01", "owner": "salvador_cpinto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090842671737588, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T12:25:12", "owner": "robbiedee04_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952007470003664, "text": "Zofia?", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:37:17", "owner": "rico.media360vr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141526480408998, "text": "There’s reason why Zofia is a mom 😩🥴", "created_at": "2025-08-06T03:03:11", "owner": "tonyramirez80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514261222002952, "text": "What about amaru?😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-06T02:59:44", "owner": "the.shitbox_fox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160680166364786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-06T02:39:10", "owner": "dreyys2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069230054281572, "text": "Ela hitting the gangsta bugs bunny pose", "created_at": "2025-08-06T02:35:08", "owner": "jovianluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049911560239091, "text": "Gridlock is the one everyone wants to know😂", "created_at": "2025-08-06T01:59:12", "owner": "devinc_51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076639598310895, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-06T00:50:39", "owner": "____brae____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889253932312823, "text": "WTF?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T21:27:17", "owner": "robertg_punkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339929308166222, "text": "DONT", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:34:13", "owner": "farhudeshun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086387410808623, "text": "I didn’t get it till the second slide 😭", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:17:00", "owner": "ilikecats1984728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061330310348966, "text": "Stop the cap. Koreans don’t shave", "created_at": "2025-08-05T13:01:11", "owner": "dan.snyder17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058707359521567, "text": "Ella and zofia are sisters", "created_at": "2025-08-05T11:14:13", "owner": "uronly_reza_stfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071864431859597, "text": "I feel like twitch would keep it hairy. No shaving, not even a little trim", "created_at": "2025-08-05T06:00:49", "owner": "anotherinternetuser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088345726774534, "text": "It took me a minute to", "created_at": "2025-08-05T06:00:45", "owner": "openmindseye_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866018371429479, "text": "That's how I make my transitions on the power points", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:28:34", "owner": "mendozsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076250567483809, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:14:01", "owner": "luisgalvan29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138429610423334, "text": "What about fuze?👀", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:56:27", "owner": "zillabash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895626967142467, "text": "Frost next?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T03:38:34", "owner": "major_ghost47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872128840404610, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-08-05T03:13:03", "owner": "ohaldair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134723728427711, "text": "No puedo darle like a esto", "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:44:22", "owner": "tobinfante_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866955037355405, "text": "@jake.luftspring", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:42:20", "owner": "holden.as", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110945647466514, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:42:05", "owner": "holden.as", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912952228169905, "text": "Diabolical 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T18:38:08", "owner": "_mr3efid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072710120091734, "text": "A lot of R6 gooners in here", "created_at": "2025-08-04T16:46:03", "owner": "bunfordije", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324654367224784, "text": "Gridlock?", "created_at": "2025-08-04T14:33:45", "owner": "vrb.balaazs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956852955977492, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-04T12:50:18", "owner": "sergiuszmag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523241044013910, "text": "Ela❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-04T07:30:38", "owner": "a_lukee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957088872971196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-04T01:44:22", "owner": "_criistian_jimenez_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939890941046617, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-03T22:04:10", "owner": "fukn_juddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087129202747649, "text": "osa : femboy", "created_at": "2025-08-03T21:32:35", "owner": "dodopasha00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860424424455397, "text": "clash is fully shaved fs", "created_at": "2025-08-03T17:03:48", "owner": "dominifr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886961677205874, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-03T14:43:19", "owner": "clooun_marios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084234997875603, "text": "Osa ??", "created_at": "2025-08-03T09:33:37", "owner": "kotgaetan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969760014775807, "text": "Bro what", "created_at": "2025-08-02T23:17:17", "owner": "philipp_spamt_dreieck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092068861644855, "text": "Zofia goated", "created_at": "2025-08-02T18:51:25", "owner": "riesenvl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072821036063493, "text": "WHERES AZAMI PLSSDD", "created_at": "2025-08-02T16:11:31", "owner": "arouf_vuitton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102187150568762, "text": "😐", "created_at": "2025-08-02T12:52:34", "owner": "k0.sven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071752610085653, "text": "Uhm", "created_at": "2025-08-02T11:03:17", "owner": "andrew_horan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961244265959513, "text": "dude", "created_at": "2025-08-02T07:41:59", "owner": "bikoskij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856335529472951, "text": "La verdad me dio asco", "created_at": "2025-08-02T01:08:31", "owner": "jesus_vdfc_39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930181537074552, "text": "i approve of this message", "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:10:03", "owner": "marc_gnf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988120344827123, "text": "Ela WOULD be heart shaped too🤣😭😭", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:29:52", "owner": "kimaiofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888405985318296, "text": "First time I’ve seen one of these be wrong. Clash does NOT have a bush, and you don’t even have Cavs hair ass on the list. Idk man leave it to the pros", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:18:27", "owner": "luke__wichelhaus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075391291803337, "text": "Now instead of clash put twitch there", "created_at": "2025-08-01T22:42:39", "owner": "login._t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956976048986953, "text": "We’re is ash?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T22:07:54", "owner": "2peezyf6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088243882743461, "text": "Bro 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-01T22:06:11", "owner": "rethvadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904666966221879, "text": "Daddy Tachanka next", "created_at": "2025-08-01T20:59:41", "owner": "jayhasabigforehead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009936800606542, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-01T16:17:36", "owner": "dilldoughs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033525314481092, "text": "No iq or ash?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T06:28:56", "owner": "byrdterps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049820078207837, "text": "how about Skopos ?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:12:48", "owner": "_nimazre_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910061476193122, "text": "I didn't start playing R6 for this 💔🥀🪫✌️", "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:10:20", "owner": "iamcatnip_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320497117234812, "text": "Why is Zofia a clean shave?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T02:35:29", "owner": "reese_worthy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990375030829247, "text": "Mira, my beloved", "created_at": "2025-08-01T00:30:38", "owner": "slowpoke_actual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874847557283740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-31T22:12:00", "owner": "shanec_ham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125031466458785, "text": "That actually seems accurate", "created_at": "2025-07-31T20:26:12", "owner": "camslmaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085918201790588, "text": "Took me a min to realize 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-31T19:24:35", "owner": "little.cy208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074767354975704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-31T18:00:04", "owner": "gavin.perron_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051813686449084, "text": "🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🧱🧱🧱🧱🧱🧱🧱🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️🕰️", "created_at": "2025-07-31T17:50:01", "owner": "holymahyar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073616114092816, "text": "What about gridlock if your top 2 ain't clash and gridlock youre a gay", "created_at": "2025-07-31T09:00:57", "owner": "richard_pheelin69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081769396698402, "text": "I had no idea what it was until it went to the next side 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-31T01:51:48", "owner": "siahdnt.gaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173753269344091, "text": "I don’t like this app anymore", "created_at": "2025-07-31T01:49:03", "owner": "wasim_got_a_nd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039425993341569, "text": "Ram next", "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:43:27", "owner": "o_its_crow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100343152589901, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:38:34", "owner": "diego_mi01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919156690014973, "text": "Nah zoph has a bush there's no doubt about it", "created_at": "2025-07-30T14:30:36", "owner": "olsonnellie7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071882540062050, "text": "real", "created_a