{"media_id": 3787402731100301652, "shortcode": "DSPjreok-lU", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSPjreok-lU/", "taken_at": "2025-12-14T12:00:00", "caption": "𝙝𝙤 𝙝𝙤 𝙝𝙤 ～\n聖誕節前夕，你準備好重溫這首大尺度聖誕歌了嗎？🎄✨\n​\n每年到這個時候，都必須要回味一下 Gaga 聖誕神曲〈Christmas Tree〉輕快又充滿暗示「聽了會臉紅」😳\n​\n沒想到琅琅上口的旋律，歌詞卻是妥妥的 18+\n第一次聽真的會愣住：「欸…這真的聖誕歌嗎？」😱\n​\n但聖誕節嘛，就是要在溫馨裡加一點刺激(?)\n才讓人每年都忍不住再 replay🎅🤣\n​\n🎧 Lady Gaga〈Christmas Tree〉\n🎥 appletv @ladygaga\n​\n-\n生活不是填滿，而是學會留白，讓感受有位置💫\n追蹤 @feelingdept 留白日常☁️\n-\n​\n#留白日常 #feelingdept #music #LadyGaga #ChristmasTree #Christmas #聖誕節 #聖誕樹 #聖誕歌 #merrychristmas #18禁聖誕歌 #兜風KTV #聖誕考古 #聖誕神曲 #洗腦聖誕歌", "owner_username": "feelingdept", "owner_id": "76145377983", "likes": 30693, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0020_DSPjreok-lU\\DSPjreok-lU_20251214_120000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086744858017462, "text": "在18禁有Cardi B的18禁嗎🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-15T00:50:55", "owner": "robing_sun", "likes": 550}, {"id": 17903540940335482, "text": "什麼歌名😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:23:29", "owner": "tsz_chan1096", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18549504595018772, "text": "Gaga寫詞真的很猛 用創意想像作詞  每一句歌詞都是深刻的對話一樣", "created_at": "2025-12-15T02:48:23", "owner": "chauxnineties", "likes": 1254}, {"id": 17927818227034845, "text": "我女神GAGA最棒了唱聖誕歌依然火辣辣😍", "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:21:59", "owner": "tan.v.vi", "likes": 130}, {"id": 18030151946554672, "text": "太喜歡Gaga最後真誠大笑的模樣😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:33:00", "owner": "feelingdept", "likes": 606}, {"id": 18055415060336265, "text": "Christmas tree’s delicious?????", "created_at": "2025-12-16T07:05:00", "owner": "kunjinho", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17968152800992630, "text": "可愛", "created_at": "2025-12-15T08:03:29", "owner": "ciao_mmii", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18127262719505720, "text": "就是要這味 哈哈❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-15T23:17:56", "owner": "uann_0425", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086578280068347, "text": "byebye，Mariah ，hello，gaga 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:28:52", "owner": "thebluebluestar", "l