{"media_id": 3789019762286718487, "shortcode": "DSVTWYSCO4X", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSVTWYSCO4X/", "taken_at": "2025-12-16T17:32:55", "caption": "🚨 Europeans Fan Zone: here’s everything you need to know! ⛸️✨\n\nSheffield is turning up the energy for Europeans 2026 with a city-centre Fan Zone at the Sheffield Peace Gardens - and everyone’s invited (whether you have arena tickets or not!).\n\nWhat’s happening?\n✅ Free-to-use artificial skating rink (skate hire included)\n📺 Big screen with live coverage + highlights\n🍴 Food stalls + entertainment all week\nand more!\n\nWhen?\n📅 10–18 January 2026\n🕙 Weekends: 10:00–20:00\n🕑 Weekdays: 14:00–20:00\n\nWhere?\n📍 Sheffield Peace Gardens\n\nBring your friends, soak up the atmosphere, and be part of something Sheffield will remember long after the final skate. Let’s make Europeans 2026 a city-wide celebration!\n\n#EuroFigure #EuroSheffield2026 #FigureSkating", "owner_username": "isueuropeans2026", "owner_id": "77107657360", "likes": 357, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0021_DSVTWYSCO4X\\DSVTWYSCO4X_20251216_173255_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0021_DSVTWYSCO4X\\DSVTWYSCO4X_20251216_173255_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0021_DSVTWYSCO4X\\DSVTWYSCO4X_20251216_173255_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0021_DSVTWYSCO4X\\DSVTWYSCO4X_20251216_173255_4.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18054013868661320", "text": "😍🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:33:45", "owner": "britishiceskating", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18101165224750310", "text": "It’s great that the event is being screened Live in the city centre!", "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:12:19", "owner": "lessismoreclutterfreeliving", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17990719865906861", "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:27:21", "owner": "___kaylee_logan___", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18049083116447498", "text": "It’s going to be an amazing week 🇬🇧⛸️", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:51:27", "owner": "darcyandhugoiceskatingduo", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18027883013773857", "text": "We can’t wait to see this set up in such an iconic city location! ⛸️🏙️🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:43:38", "owner": "visitsheffield", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17859290976564312", "text": "Super excited to be volunteering at The Fan Zone on the Friday. \n♥️ 🇬🇧 ⛸️⛸️", "created_at": "2025-12-18T16:29:37", "owner": "foxy_cakes_bakes", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18414293248189988", "text": "Exciting news.\nHope there will be some basic coaching for new skaters. Even 5 minutes of tips will set new skaters on a better pathway to participation. ❤️⛸️", "created_at": "2025-12-19T04:24:02", "owner": "inspirebykim", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18108641986654063", "text": "Artificial as in plastic ice? Or real ice?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:25:29", "owner": "marlene_on_ice", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18119189923492715", "text": "Send me this post", "created_at": "2025-12-17T11:06:22", "owner": "sheffield_explore", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17864525676455405", "text": "is it real ice or plastic?", "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:52:55", "owner": "hooriaa_113", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["eurofigure", "eurosheffield2026", "figureskating"]},
{"media_id": 3788910012224091438, "shortcode": "DSU6ZTkibUu", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSU6ZTkibUu/", "taken_at": "2025-12-16T16:00:02", "caption": "Whatever you do...don't look! 👀 \n\nAH! You looked! 😜 Now that you're here, #CES2026 is right around the corner. Are you ready?", "owner_username": "dassaultsystemes", "owner_id": "28324717", "likes": 384, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0022_DSU6ZTkibUu\\DSU6ZTkibUu_20251216_160002.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18088841563966531", "text": "Just admit that you guys are making planes and we’re all good", "created_at": "2025-12-17T06:05:41", "owner": "non.vultus", "likes": 9}, {"id": "17867089452436123", "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:13:06", "owner": "nguyenben85gmail", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18033486473765709", "text": "Now, where is the corner? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T16:07:39", "owner": "itshussnainrajput", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18099953044805771", "text": "What font do you use?", "created_at": "2025-12-17T05:11:29", "owner": "bernaduspranata", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18066730547155330", "text": "So ready!! 🎉👊", "created_at": "2025-12-18T18:50:56", "owner": "smemedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18418100365188150", "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 There is no coffee in that mug.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T19:02:42", "owner": "paoloat514", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18108979996623905", "text": "Darn it you got me.", "created_at": "2025-12-16T21:02:56", "owner": "agathe.vsno", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["ces2026"]},
{"media_id": 3788939980097825596, "shortcode": "DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00/", "taken_at": "2025-12-16T14:54:24", "caption": "//\nthailand, gibraltar and spain", "owner_username": "aganyu", "owner_id": "4090647763", "likes": 148, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_10.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_11.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_12.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_13.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_14.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_15.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_16.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_17.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_18.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0023_DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00\\DSVBNZVAas8ml5Xgek7QCVSTmqifKcFpkgbya00_20251216_145424_9.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3783132880201956432, "shortcode": "DSAY0-GibxQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSAY0-GibxQ/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T14:36:57", "caption": "日本利用压电瓷砖将脚步转化为电能。这些瓷砖捕捉\n来自你脚步的动能。当你行走时,你的重量和动作会\n对瓷砖产生压力。瓷砖会轻微弯曲,从而产生机械应\n力。瓷砖内部的压电材料将这种应力转化为电能。每\n一步都会产生少量电荷,而数百万步结合在一起就能\n产生足够的电力来驱动 LED 灯、数显示屏和传感\n器。在像涩谷车站这样繁忙的地方, 天大约有 240\n万个脚步为这一系统作出贡献。这些电能可以被储存\n或立即使用,从而减少对传统电力来源的依赖,并支\n持可持续的城市基础设施。这种方法将日常运动转化\n为实用的可再生能源 #日本#知识 ##实 #你知道吗\n#推荐 #科技#创新 #历史 技技 实验 #热门", "owner_username": "savagesnipeshq", "owner_id": "61259600920", "likes": 19286, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0024_DSAY0-GibxQ\\DSAY0-GibxQ_20251208_143657.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18071376869076178, "text": "Marvelous can someone translate?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:44:42", "owner": "cappedlens", "likes": 1023}, {"id": 18414655900186394, "text": "I fully support her.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:46:04", "owner": "imreev_6", "likes": 3409}, {"id": 17939351289101859, "text": "Is this Hollywood version of big boss", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:47:34", "owner": "iyappanarjun_", "likes": 146}, {"id": 18514149646069668, "text": "I have two Big reason for support her", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:42:46", "owner": "__enkh.o", "likes": 1052}, {"id": 17854207425589175, "text": "Agree👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:17:25", "owner": "rin_zuala_____", "likes": 76}, {"id": 17868093840490105, "text": "What’s the @ lol before someone asks", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:31:05", "owner": "merrowsergio", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17970849824991007, "text": "I don’t know what’s going on, and I have no idea which language she’s speaking 😂 But I fully support her, and I’m waiting to see her 💀……….", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:09:11", "owner": "bounceback_24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085549973044186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:27:01", "owner": "berryflash2025", "likes": 93}, {"id": 17874607965455045, "text": "Is this Albanian? The woman sounds very Turkish", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:50:27", "owner": "realamk1", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18146522677441068, "text": "Go girl ❤️‍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:25:16", "owner": "pvt.sxxeb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18413223205140673, "text": "Have no clue what's being said but I could listen all day 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:47:37", "owner": "sirr2015", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866529337438775, "text": "😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:22:35", "owner": "neha__baddie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027523463716518, "text": "She gets my vote", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:22:26", "owner": "orateyouth6106", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18103007077664186, "text": "HYYY FRENDS", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:33:05", "owner": "its_niharika_jarwal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331770235210335, "text": "I only speak English (unfortunately) will someone translate for me please? 😟", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:27:36", "owner": "hollyyhobbie", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18096890014880392, "text": "Dear Instagram this would be a great time for one of those Ai meta translator appearance", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:52:00", "owner": "azazel.the.one", "likes": 545}, {"id": 18032216942742596, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:31:25", "owner": "bat_anssh", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17941218191964955, "text": "Hyyy friend's 🌸❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:27:06", "owner": "sheetal_vijay009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889530742260537, "text": "Her @?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:48:49", "owner": "engineer.doctor.businessman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107577982567556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T06:46:43", "owner": "_niyansan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027649778774099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:55:36", "owner": "a_jay0_1", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17929063815153265, "text": "She wins the argument by default 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:44:18", "owner": "victory_stone89", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18064282418548105, "text": "What's her name", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:48:52", "owner": "bclarke87