reated_at": "2025-12-09T16:44:26", "owner": "althugg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162102184395556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:17:42", "owner": "iamqayyumarafat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877809880356219, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:11:40", "owner": "moshiur.anik.9987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076224581585017, "text": "Guys agree with her she's ryt", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:07:50", "owner": "subba_jogi04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101644186749079, "text": "i also agree with her, but whats her id?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:48:53", "owner": "devil___652", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915891607245231, "text": "These Eastern European girls never shut up🤦🏻‍♂️😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:40:45", "owner": "jayholland91_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086204432000688, "text": "woman(with big titi) always right👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:37:29", "owner": "quanganh25.drafts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916380601087430, "text": "❌ Language. ✅ She is for 100% correct in this argument", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:33:07", "owner": "ninetytwoplays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147918619387470, "text": "Yeah you are right Miss yeah. I am with you 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:23:51", "owner": "dreamispola_nd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073576376203662, "text": "She is saying. Come. Come look at them. What are you hungry for?.... You're welcome", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:19:51", "owner": "glicenji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083654546017689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:19:49", "owner": "___r.marjan___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030565511769091, "text": "Can anyone tell me what did she said?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:13:50", "owner": "mushfiqueibtashum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029425280759613, "text": "Is this a reality show", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:03:13", "owner": "cappedlens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355586455160059, "text": "Kiss it", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:58:32", "owner": "p.rbertsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069968717524005, "text": "Whatever they're arguing about, I think the woman had a point.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:50:18", "owner": "cagay.angelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922953067055531, "text": "Coz she did your favor", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:36:44", "owner": "vaishzoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972431325974387, "text": "She is huge right 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:26:09", "owner": "whocaressumon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068519483123300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:24:15", "owner": "ryanbenhalima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297191086258685, "text": "To whom it may concern, her @ is @xhennetafetahuu", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:00:49", "owner": "mukicejku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305515873265984, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:20:00", "owner": "wasi_rifat0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048786650443132, "text": "🔥🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:13:42", "owner": "md.musa.ahmmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090977140744119, "text": "hajde kqyra whats your onlyfans", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:43:36", "owner": "19_gilgamesh_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861660043542473, "text": "I am with her you all she is right don’t disturb her", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:31:46", "owner": "shadowanime_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192692074336047, "text": "@hanzala_zahoorr bilkul theek keh rahi hai", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:09:42", "owner": "shakirmehmood144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100935655694442, "text": "I agree with her", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:28:59", "owner": "tashi_gyatso__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041930414505602, "text": "이 언니 말이 다 맞다", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:13:45", "owner": "dopauilty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085188236488219, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:59:41", "owner": "baigahmed635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918145294226456, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:52:33", "owner": "dr.sanatan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120141901552273, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:06:56", "owner": "katrielmarcillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021344393667529, "