{"media_id": 3759347808395367753, "shortcode": "DQr4unyjJVJ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQr4unyjJVJ/", "taken_at": "2025-11-05T19:00:00", "caption": "Asking people what Halloween costume is the biggest red flag 🎃🚩\n\n#interviews #nottingham #clubbing #monstanottingham", "owner_username": "uonorientalsoc", "owner_id": "48093164849", "likes": 494, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0025_DQr4unyjJVJ\\DQr4unyjJVJ_20251105_190000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18095353177642505", "text": "which one is @rhysgales_", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:16:40", "owner": "monstanottingham", "likes": 3}, {"id": "17861703870518835", "text": "I hope u know ur id can be seen behind yer phone bro 😬", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:52:59", "owner": "reignbarrun", "likes": 8}, {"id": "18334533730238607", "text": "rhys😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:07:01", "owner": "aimabitlost", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18083115037997931", "text": "rhys man 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:10:10", "owner": "ig.ellaaaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18085204109313197", "text": "R they all British born Asians", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:36:10", "owner": "meagz_maple", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18176952193317949", "text": "@rhysgales_ so out of it bro 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:33:12", "owner": "fmasiddo", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["interviews", "nottingham", "clubbing", "monstanottingham"]},
{"media_id": 3786633587400178166, "shortcode": "DSM0y9vjPn2", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSM0y9vjPn2/", "taken_at": "2025-12-13T10:34:41", "caption": "以前見到人哋旅遊自帶杯麵/糧食，就覺得難得出嚟玩就唔好咁計較啦，但感受到歐洲物價嘅鐵拳之後嘅我：🥨🥐🥖🍞🥪\n#歐洲 #歐遊 #窮遊 #謎因 #梗 #europe #meme", "owner_username": "ayanaayaaaa", "owner_id": "47895657831", "likes": 8281, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0026_DSM0y9vjPn2\\DSM0y9vjPn2_20251213_103441.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17962028468870163, "text": "難得去歐洲，每三天還是會找一天去餐廳吃一頓晚餐", "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:24:00", "owner": "qh_masterofnone", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18104532574731999, "text": "正常呀，特別是遊客區，叫份主食閒閒地15-20歐元，叫埋飲品，連小費25-30歐元，在西餐廳叫枝水都6-7歐元。除非budget 多一點，否則不可能三餐外出用膳，餐廳吃早餐叫份三文治5-10歐，咖啡另計3-6歐", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:43:41", "owner": "peggywan428", "likes": 218}, {"id": 18105354694710175, "text": "well 超市买的和好点餐馆还是有区别😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:51:42", "owner": "glen.zhuu", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18083315317892997, "text": "😂至少面包好吃", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:42:46", "owner": "tklau1990", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18074088578359908, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-17T15:35:00", "owner": "herykasena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953269978025346, "text": "I love their supermarket, a lot of bread choices 🤤🤤", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:42:27", "owner": "cheerwonghkg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17880102672439037, "text": "looks fun though 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T09:35:06", "owner": "yellingattrees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930711484018165, "text": "你錢包夠厚 就可以", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:00:40", "owner": "kecasey06023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157310734408771, "text": "歡迎來到歐洲", "created_at": "2025-12-19T12:52:53", "owner": "tony.lphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881149330445696, "text": "別理想了。理想的東西都很難食", "created_at": "2025-12-16T18:52:37", "owner": "kaavin_yau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890230660263774, "text": "this is the equivalent of going to japan and dining in family mart", "created_at": "2025-12-17T10:54:50", "owner": "instadavechang", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081439913177369, "text": "我啱啱由平嘅匈牙利，斯洛伐克，同捷克玩到去貴嘅維也納，真係好似呢個post 咁樣。食早餐已經20歐，食lunch 同dinner 又150-200 歐 👻👻\n我哋夜晚仲要去搵超市八五折優惠嘅食物，同埋有大把韓國人，同埋歐洲人會一齊喺6:pm搶減價貨。 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:58:59", "owner": "princeeeed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845277307629253, "text": "我自己做就好 還好我高中餐飲科 大部分都會做", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:52:49", "owner": "jenhe1445", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114002623607397, "text": "Saying just Europe is limiting and meaningless… Europe is diverse, every country is different", "created_at": "2025-12-14T20:46:59", "owner": "san_vittore_87", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17876158131451133, "text": "@lilililliannnn @yuchieh.nn", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:50:35", "owner": "iris_ssss166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934038772131307, "text": "😭💯accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-18T19:40:02", "owner": "drowzzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075608549192581, "text": "Talk to yourself 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-18T15:31:31", "owner": "izahar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017996552625885, "text": "旅行 vs 生活", "created_at": "2025-12-14T13:27:21", "owner": "damienchen22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096349207887119, "text": "😢😍😢ghhh", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:27:37", "owner": "zhouliangxingzhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106866001635006, "text": "@chien_jung01", "created_at": "2025-12-16T15:18:00", "owner": "shanyeowo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085374494032438, "text": "both look shit to me", "created_at": "2025-12-15T03:06:22", "owner": "ansonceay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870490705410775, "text": "Then fuck back and continue with ur dog", "created_at": "2025-12-18T10:02:06", "owner": "minh_buai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090085777769151, "text": "還好吧，法國好吃的一大堆，吃的好胖😍", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:09:55", "owner": "lee_ming_gym", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18139201216462624, "text": "係窮呀 屌你個係", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:27:15", "owner": "kjisann", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["歐洲", "歐遊", "窮遊", "謎因", "梗", "europe", "meme"]},
{"media_id": 3765751082879451491, "shortcode": "DRCoqh3koFj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRCoqh3koFj/", "taken_at": "2025-11-14T15:03:01", "caption": "When the palette is right, the glow is undeniable. 🎨💫\n\nSome people are made for light, airy color... and she’s absolutely one of them. 🌸\nThe pastels lifted her features, brightened her complexion, and gave that sweet, luminous softness. ✨\n\nBook your color analysis session at The Color Girl Miami! 🦋✨ \n\n#coloranalysis #undertone #beauty #makeup #haircolor #fashion #colorconsultant #miamibeach #lightspring", "owner_username": "thecolorgirlmiami", "owner_id": "67972382591", "likes": 334049, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0027_DRCoqh3koFj\\DRCoqh3koFj_20251114_150301.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18129002275492468, "text": "She looks pale in light spring", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:14:19", "owner": "sangam_apocalypse", "likes": 9710}, {"id": 17859950877546468, "text": "I feel like she looks way too pale with the light spring", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:03:26", "owner": "_unwritten_book", "likes": 3913}, {"id": 18096684244841095, "text": "The other one seemed to add color to her face in a good way ?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:36:53", "owner": "taraturai", "likes": 6122}, {"id": 18062354882183943, "text": "this is the only color analysis that I’ve seen a difference!!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:58:04", "owner": "chanelleyy17", "likes": 42804}, {"id": 18176245141368877, "text": "LOL I love how her “little” voice came out looking at you her big sis for affirmation that she is INDEED a pastel person haha. Something I think only sisters will understand. So cute and you are so good at this Paige! I want to redo mine all over again just to be shocked again LOL", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:48:14", "owner": "danidemiami", "likes": 893}, {"id": 17946687068934207, "text": "She is light spring. But need a bit more colors. This one you show is to pale.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:35:57", "owner": "gesers_galleri", "likes": 20730}, {"id": 17918409168207499, "text": "The second one makes her looks so pale the first one makes her look tan and lifeful", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:21:39", "owner": "esmechacon3", "likes": 408}, {"id": 18057891536275940, "text": "This is so cool! As someone with albinism, I have pale skin and light blue eyes but warmer undertones and have no clue what color analysis would be for me!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:33:43", "owner": "oliviaelizao", "likes": 100}, {"id": 17878052403432536, "text": "No sé si estoy mal, o es por qué estoy high, pero no le queda mejor la segunda paleta de colores?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:41:04", "owner": "rrayorj", "likes": 165}, {"id": 18554363311033156, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:15:06", "owner": "codywoedy", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17862462579460508, "text": "How is she a light spring? It washed her out completely. The Spring gave her color and made her look alive.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:37:37", "owner": "sargent_stuart", "likes": 328}, {"id": 18105440476710805, "text": "She’s so beautiful but really comes alive in the light spring.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:08:52", "owner": "leilackennedy", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17877012225437095, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:27:26", "owner": "__che77os__", "likes": 398}, {"id": 18103726918629489, "text": "Nooooooo, no no", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:12:44", "owner": "jacky.neuman", "likes": 67}, {"id": 17914736499088547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:10:15", "owner": "mazz_n_cheese", "likes": 9727}, {"id": 18396933739132595, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:53:17", "owner": "shikharsinghsarang", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17921478687197012, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:14:14", "owner": "alfredoharmsen_", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17887483968263455, "text": "Sticking to only one season limits your fashion creativity 😂 Mix and match!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:46:57", "owner": "nuj.koch", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17860992444539335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:47:45", "owner": "j4mie876", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18124701481508063, "text": "That is NOT pastel! Light Spring is bright and light. Not muted", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:43:03", "owner": "selenapet", "likes": 881}, {"id": 18002491640821133, "text": "You can see an added filter a second before you pull the true spring pallet off 🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:44:15", "owner": "kimnave", "likes": 97}, {"id": 17986878431750863, "text": "Woaahhh it blessed my eyes✨✨", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:38:12", "owner": "not_mugdhoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086372257998700, "text": "Light spring was beautiful", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:06:54", "owner": "bmakingmoves", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905418388295737, "text": "Do you sell these drapes? I love them!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:33:47", "owner": "beccarettenberger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978650619782061, "text": "This would look terrible on me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:55:25", "owner": "paulapbpb", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18053089817335970, "text": "She’s a true summer! Pastel but with darker undertones!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:35:35", "owner": "ohcloudgirl", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17926182906156048, "text": "If she didn't have the highlights in her hair, would you have come to the same conclusion?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:52:01", "owner": "soarpurpose", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18075611099519960, "text": "She was washed out on the light spring lol is this even real", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:09:56", "owner": "sg.suzumiya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18418460206119339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:47:36", "owner": "rentresna", "likes": 155}, {"id": 18052881599370109, "text": "The client didn't know how she should've felt. Notice she immediately looked at the lady in the mirror to see what her reaction was. I'm my opinion, it's still personal preference and I think based on personality. The light spring in this case, fits her personality. Idk about which makes her skin look better 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:24:33", "owner": "gratefullove1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067939802104996, "text": "yes except that peachy tan tone on the far left is pissing me off", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:04:22", "owner": "mama._.zel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18095841511846574, "text": "The spring washed her out", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:01:36", "owner": "hbsunflower", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033558029725889, "text": "No hate or anything but true spring fits her better. Light spring washes out her face and makes her unique features unnoticeable", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:05:21", "owner": "pauli92634", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18344890723204781, "text": "looks same", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:11:48", "owner": "zyumaexito", "likes": 188}, {"id": 18075440939339966, "text": "I think she should wear what she wants but the light spring colors seem to wash her out to me.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:45:23", "owner": "moved_by_the_spirit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843267640611665, "text": "Watched her face the whole time... didnt change", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:55:45", "owner": "cuddy.got.em", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088375612938484, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:27:22", "owner": "lyrics_6_s", "likes": 6186}, {"id": 18063541676559246, "text": "Can’t wait for this trend to end when it’s disproven or something else comes along. It’s so annoying.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:06:44", "owner": "lauren_andersen87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046836860422817, "text": "No offense to anyone who does these, I rarely see any difference in how they look next to the colors, like if it was a dark green and a neon orange yeah I can see smthn, but pink or lighter pink? Nothing.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:17:47", "owner": "lexi_mecheng03", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18552883648014100, "text": "I’m strictly minty ice", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:54:57", "owner": "rguydetroit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074840273018429, "text": "How do you make this work in the winter time? It’s so hard with all of the red and black and dark colors for the holidays.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:40:57", "owner": "triciafikeky", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046425494443607, "text": "Stunning light spring.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:45:51", "owner": "calmalchemist", "likes": 101}, {"id": 17922503550185004, "text": "I am a light spring 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:39:01", "owner": "javiermcintosh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941278261093755, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:14:56", "owner": "_ursnikhilll18", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18091430368917738, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:35:55", "owner": "realhnl", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17884543506406887, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:54:18", "owner": "fatgirthyleg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097505131816239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:00:10", "owner": "_seems_odd_", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18161512456390483, "text": "I think I know her", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:17:51", "owner": "jj_.frmgu671", "likes": 65}, {"id": 17851265244548157, "text": "What is this for", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:34:18", "owner": "rylie_cheers2012_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18050574866355980, "text": "Light spring", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:43:53", "owner": "buckleysgarden", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18377242753148393, "text": "I’m jealous", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:36:06", "owner": "imfreakingmoonstone", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17858577843550981, "text": "Light sprimg", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:00:13", "owner": "maddie_and_her_fav_dog", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17981868299923632, "text": "She should be fairykei", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:54:38", "owner": "rummulas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088197491056688, "text": "Antes / despuesn't", "created_at": "2025-12-19T22:33:21", "owner": "mate.mor03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114059215520780, "text": "Yes, true spring is too bright.  Try soft autumn versus light spring.", "created_at": "2025-12-19T16:16:12", "owner": "dedicatednutritionist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080941646126415, "text": "Light spring washed her out", "created_at": "2025-12-19T13:36:05", "owner": "eva____agbondimwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847827925619371, "text": "I might be in the minority but the first looked better", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:53:16", "owner": "eguanakampala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087818551996874, "text": "They both look bad", "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:29:25", "owner": "iamfrida.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063543977223280, "text": "Huh??", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:41:06", "owner": "omg_itsjasonfoster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991849257909079, "text": "Light weight bb", "created_at": "2025-12-19T07:27:00", "owner": "max_from_alaska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127136632507989, "text": "\"This is true retard....now this is *light* retard\" 🤌🤌🤌", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:53:27", "owner": "jacobtworks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173626291370813, "text": "Being pale is not a bad thing the light spring clearly brought out the flush of her cheeks and lips while the true made her look orange", "created_at": "2025-12-19T01:16:56", "owner": "flowerot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100192264765086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:48:22", "owner": "donkeyking_tube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299402791258781, "text": "From agua to water ! 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:05:11", "owner": "vitorgrassato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299009179276164, "text": "I wish I had one", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:37:11", "owner": "mollasalehinewsha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939263575108296, "text": "👏🔥Def a light spring!", "created_at": "2025-12-18T21:00:14", "owner": "color_n_books", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093899947901449, "text": "I gravitate to wanting to wear pastels and I definitely think I’m a winter 🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:42:26", "owner": "maritzaholguin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095269922499948, "text": "Bettaaarrr😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T00:43:47", "owner": "dream_hunter.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302023786280437, "text": "@mpq.bella", "created_at": "2025-12-17T22:54:27", "owner": "anny.bny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972775698964086, "text": "colors will change if backgrownd had diffetent colors.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:27:17", "owner": "diguila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085372432860328, "text": "1st one is better. 2nd one makes her too pale.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:20:25", "owner": "lonestar758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133401106490513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T09:13:55", "owner": "dayssappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972530238968884, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:56:06", "owner": "6tyleryoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889418530396968, "text": "She looks super pale to me.", "created_at": "2025-12-17T03:27:21", "owner": "heathenx916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545871358044100, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:29:22", "owner": "freshwatelll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138842620476207, "text": "@thisgensucks", "created_at": "2025-12-16T00:45:54", "owner": "_james_cousins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869505832497855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-16T00:19:38", "owner": "hipsterfoxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543168712039006, "text": "Gaslight ultra pro max", "created_at": "2025-12-16T00:14:50", "owner": "casually_boring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101635603616111, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T21:27:24", "owner": "victormgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851470594602536, "text": "Banker", "created_at": "2025-12-15T20:55:06", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092913145934093, "text": "You. Are. A. Light. Spring.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T17:56:13", "owner": "alexfinger__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303350260270528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-15T07:36:06", "owner": "walkermull1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039949610708472, "text": "?????? is she really spring at all", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:21:41", "owner": "keenanwill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930331873150395, "text": "First one was better.", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:09:11", "owner": "jackknife_jimmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994302297855294, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T22:31:34", "owner": "radja_jajabear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914543713099907, "text": "Wtf are you smoking?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T17:37:17", "owner": "miti_dan_florin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089787199965277, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:14:07", "owner": "pisanggorengasem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874581328459553, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:02:33", "owner": "mrjonestaughtyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089138594301058, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:47:32", "owner": "austinhengen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075250508205499, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T14:36:46", "owner": "aleks.mk7r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121523491539310, "text": "Your fooling girls 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:55:21", "owner": "jamieright.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172953904372835, "text": "The true spring colors came forward, dominating her, saw the color first. Light spring was a good balance since her features and coloring aren’t high contrast.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T08:57:20", "owner": "jujo79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094321858722889, "text": "??????? Nah.,.", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:40:56", "owner": "sfair88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894735205362681, "text": "Não mudou nd", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:43:22", "owner": "l1lich_lick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901158991185819, "text": "yo no sé estaré mal yo pero la veo igual con todo", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:32:50", "owner": "dubrazca3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026803505588470, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:23:42", "owner": "ben3308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048094490689706, "text": "The second one looked so bad, I feel like it wasn’t even close.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:23:35", "owner": "ben3308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076431749522095, "text": "Im true spring", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:13:23", "owner": "issieb_dot_com", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080386664175383, "text": "Looks to reddish with the true spring", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:26:15", "owner": "s1imerita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061663859243893, "text": "👵👵👵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:06:34", "owner": "dylan._3321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143848552450718, "text": "I could do better than this lady at this point………..", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:48:16", "owner": "blaise.odom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059426399287277, "text": "Is this a new bulls**t trend ?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:47:49", "owner": "stephano3535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866422471525435, "text": "Why can’t I see any difference 😭 I wanna know what I am", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:34:14", "owner": "cannacieloedibles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402146785127573, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:34:13", "owner": "uc64__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069612089527369, "text": "it's just a suggestion", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:24:04", "owner": "lemonide_the_best", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923736031053631, "text": "This one i can actually see", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:25:55", "owner": "rhennrainbow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115085098598533, "text": "You can tell she’s a light spring because your eyes immediately are drawn upward to her face - not down to the colors!", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:48:06", "owner": "devotedgarden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144869251453150, "text": "You guys are high on crack", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:40:35", "owner": "mzmarna5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079189136274946, "text": "But what does that mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:44:47", "owner": "stacy.9626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903671212318960, "text": "Perfect example of inventing  problem that never existed to \"sell the solution\" 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:41:00", "owner": "nickxplore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087099611067127, "text": "Je ne comprends rien à ce truc", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:36:36", "owner": "_im.the.real_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064775909179933, "text": "Yeah I don’t see it at all, I thought she looked better with the first colors bc they warmed up her face. The second colors make her look washed out. Idk.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:48:33", "owner": "purple_spacekitty_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070765163094605, "text": "She’s so pretty", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:14:14", "owner": "xo_zelda9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044002244697642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:40:39", "owner": "creativeusername13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097624606860778, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:43:21", "owner": "friendlyneighbourhoodalistair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856180285577289, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:47:32", "owner": "gawenda_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065897249452801, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:34:31", "owner": "azouzi_ibrahim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066498485612580, "text": "You are a full to light gullible 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:19:16", "owner": "maximumnycfc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055835207324283, "text": "So I got this juicer from temu and it's like alright but you should invest in a strong durable one so it won't bend", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:05:58", "owner": "7erik7hedberg7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061479335237962, "text": "Yeah I don’t think she needed that to know. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:49:45", "owner": "ferbullies_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412428859186887, "text": "Essa foi a única análise de cor que eu não vi diferença nenhuma AKAKAKAKAK", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:15:23", "owner": "raissatkd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926812894080646, "text": "She is the pastel color", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:44:41", "owner": "mama_ofminions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903273010322382, "text": "Definitely not a fan of the light spring but whatever, literally wear what you like, bestie. We all think you look pale, boring and washed out, though", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:01:57", "owner": "yagirlgrendy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114970678573075, "text": "1988 Deja vu", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:48:32", "owner": "stonewell_farm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084847271003055, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:37:13", "owner": "oldmanstyle86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987956814867907, "text": "What are these for", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:36:08", "owner": "luisgarcia12101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050630438386213, "text": "Fortune telling. Wait for them to have a big reaction then agree as if you were going to say that", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:50:09", "owner": "christian.t.freed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100733803696466, "text": "The first one was much better", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:39:06", "owner": "marydubosestewart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088879288971554, "text": "Light washes you out! It’s definitely a no!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:35:01", "owner": "katerina.gil.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948316170934776, "text": "Bruh, what's changed?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:24:30", "owner": "tristandell1598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871844029468047, "text": "me when im a spring and very light", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:47:28", "owner": "eviltwinzark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306244153251933, "text": "Another one lost", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:47:13", "owner": "dirkschef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079671895907385, "text": "Wtf am i watching", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:58:23", "owner": "literallytheguywhoasked", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981066594936742, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:31:57", "owner": "knatter_wheelie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072039317345404, "text": "I washed her out completely", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:34:00", "owner": "kylielouise17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994357290850593, "text": "I don’t get it", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:57:04", "owner": "rachael_blooms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883707859421206, "text": "Fraud.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:20:17", "owner": "joohi_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053292521651796, "text": "lit the same", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:43:14", "owner": "violetachhr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059898461634450, "text": "Girls r u d^mb?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:31:46", "owner": "noam__agassi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351651907161048, "text": "I don’t like the light spring but I digress", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:00:06", "owner": "doneshahelenmarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101680720688540, "text": "All the hate is ridiculous 🙄", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:15:05", "owner": "skyleranoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182829667355275, "text": "Why do I always think the other one is nicer 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:43:38", "owner": "stockholmskan08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961673092007192, "text": "Am sorry I don’t get it?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:38:02", "owner": "gersaincastelan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073630907032538, "text": "I don’t agree tho k she would be better in warm non spring tones", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:55:22", "owner": "traceyrea7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145430587447782, "text": "I don’t see a difference. Can someone tell what I’m missing?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:36:08", "owner": "mama.johns25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073830179588657, "text": "But Debbie…pastels? 😏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:10:10", "owner": "swabwitchofsalem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084188882098903, "text": "I love this 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:56:44", "owner": "thebrainrotfactory444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115453501502739, "text": "Ok turning my phone off now from this on my feed", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:37:27", "owner": "realius1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069109094108376, "text": "Where did u get that fabrics with all colors??? 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:03:34", "owner": "julieosorioinc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030982169750539, "text": "Ouuuuuu I need to do this I genuinely have no idea what I would be!!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:40:09", "owner": "jillianfournierr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099597442808759, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:32:44", "owner": "sergey_shkryabin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870039124405104, "text": "Is that a SCI/ART 12 Seasonal Color Analysis System?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:22:41", "owner": "benkrisfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868390924498912, "text": "i wishhhhh", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:00:03", "owner": "angelica_espanax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852740821543210, "text": "Do them in reverse", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:42:14", "owner": "nogovjustcallmeq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058168739296014, "text": "I like her better in the true spring.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:25:21", "owner": "salmisra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890348194389147, "text": "I wonder how much her current hair color affects this.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:40:20", "owner": "alaskafishingguide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089623808303358, "text": "Someone please explain this in football terms. Thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:42:25", "owner": "supersull54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088882438787428, "text": "don’t agree", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:08:06", "owner": "kristinsimon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131689660491702, "text": "True spring looks nicer in my opinion", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:55:24", "owner": "wuddupsierra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106407520713280, "text": "Absolutely no difference 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:12:59", "owner": "vanvineyards", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071072066524938, "text": "I wanna see the make up done", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:34:31", "owner": "killbillsbitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850644136564629, "text": "Is it for a dress or something?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:15:20", "owner": "cooperlandeche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031037987547033, "text": "This is really cool. I wish I could see what mine would be.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:19:17", "owner": "mindy_bin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955766362016828, "text": "I’m late to this but I thought I was light spring because I’m definitely more yellowyy warm toned but I think I’m too muted? Can someone type me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:11:40", "owner": "julia_wiegmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855272425576299, "text": "It's the same haha bullshit trend", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:48:55", "owner": "kieran.mcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073571024254767, "text": "Welcome to the club, sweetie!🩷💛🩵🤍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:34:09", "owner": "jagarbelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085796780490776, "text": "This feels like non-scientific mumbo jumbo", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:53:10", "owner": "theloracollective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051582008676371, "text": "I wanna do it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:21:57", "owner": "lysapea_luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116437504567880, "text": "????!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:40:46", "owner": "waleed__7_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137957686466056, "text": "@claudiadelari 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:51:43", "owner": "fmfonse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068939957616680, "text": "So if we are a spring what colors do we where in autumn and winter?!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:09:53", "owner": "seasaltandcoconut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424085182115951, "text": "I can never tell. I think I have a problem seeing color.  Maybe why I wear black.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:32:49", "owner": "melanie.eastwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079067966146239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:46:51", "owner": "boots_pv_ltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101314537686347, "text": "Loving your videosss❤️ thank you for existing ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:27:54", "owner": "moggyyy_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083548712470603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:30:03", "owner": "lawyerglebbredikhin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022325327788118, "text": "It’s almost like lighter colors reflect more light", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:56:45", "owner": "j.brad.leonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032933318736338, "text": "why did the lighting change before the light spring palette was revealed?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:46:56", "owner": "sn0wang31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878752291430807, "text": "Light sping so washes her out the first one makes her look so much more full of life", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:29:02", "owner": "comet.c0s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058430177275817, "text": "Ain’t no black ppl on your page ?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:45:46", "owner": "nachosnburritos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047276270438193, "text": "Nice selling point", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:07:56", "owner": "paulpablopaulito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100183537703946, "text": "Ohhh my gosssshhhh you guyyysss… duuuuude.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:46:36", "owner": "s_i_n_g_3_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100843840706188, "text": "Dude", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:46:40", "owner": "nickdabeez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010946252646939, "text": "What a difference 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:32:42", "owner": "danigrahampederso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093053594308054, "text": "CARTEL PASTEL", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:24:41", "owner": "prince_patelk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116027845564605, "text": "Is it just me or her whole face tone just connected in the second one", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:15:03", "owner": "kittv.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096014452848378, "text": "Ok hear me out, this video looks like an ad for a mobile game with a character running on the track to reach her head.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:47:57", "owner": "m95ez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149430049428510, "text": "I’m so glad that I don’t understand anything here🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:08:01", "owner": "maximilianodolaval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940444704962978, "text": "What does this indicate? Her cloths?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:55:34", "owner": "steveoh________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076443803336325, "text": "Just blend theory", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:02:36", "owner": "lucasbratec09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098695120808544, "text": "You're all doing too much now. She is not \"light spring\" she's spring, the first colours.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:50:50", "owner": "kim.eyles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901118044334753, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:36:14", "owner": "the_real_weeege", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051712901344975, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:32:11", "owner": "herrprettylifestyle555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894485551220890, "text": "Where do you get your color analysis drapes?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:14:51", "owner": "marthaevalyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966243681840617, "text": "What about for a African American person?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:44:32", "owner": "ellionnoille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120020095478821, "text": "I thought i saw a glow with the true spring and then the glow disappeared with light 🤷🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:53:53", "owner": "lee_ap___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048581363680595, "text": "afaik pastel is food thats contains diced carrot, potato and meat... sometimes vermicelli... hummm yummy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:59:37", "owner": "rixkidev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543256402017523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:24", "owner": "elibrat16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985398633922326, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:16", "owner": "blessings_loading", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144397924434323, "text": "Are y'all okay lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:28", "owner": "theremedy187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928116385159807, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:50:34", "owner": "iel.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068909348096683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:41:33", "owner": "jaden_waden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940780318092673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:20:05", "owner": "t__riich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036234776513651, "text": "so there's no one seeing the color of the whole video is changing before the color wheel thingy is even changed?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:25:00", "owner": "nashirogen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041769734498835, "text": "I made the mistake a of buying a dress in those colors thinking I could pull it off. I couldn’t have been more wrong. $400 of wrong. 😑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:20:42", "owner": "erica.russi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543118480044563, "text": "Diğeri daha iyiydi dostum", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:24", "owner": "_rabia369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050726573689409, "text": "I’m clueless…i can’t see the difference. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:48", "owner": "trd.on.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895682308359011, "text": "??? Ofc the first one is better", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:13:23", "owner": "bannie25eats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093802339849013, "text": "Love this! I need to I need to know where these drapes are from", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:02:03", "owner": "ellewilliamsbeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842344114629536, "text": "see how only ugIy women are criticising her.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:40:12", "owner": "bruhig_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145965994442360, "text": "lol stole this from the Chinese woman", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:18:30", "owner": "chiki.uno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079298066466952, "text": "Koja prevara bato", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:13:16", "owner": "kosanovic.miroslav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546465136050131, "text": "Do you do the same test thingy under different colors of light?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:31:02", "owner": "tyler_middi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905960797280269, "text": "What are we looking for when we do this because I liked how the first one made her cheeks look Rosier.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:51:54", "owner": "rawcoral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064940129625609, "text": "This is the only time I've ever been able to see a difference", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:17:10", "owner": "annakureks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977282460791197, "text": "true spring is just perfect", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:39:59", "owner": "mhanyhisham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090832426939912, "text": "\"Wowwwwww 🐶\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:16:38", "owner": "i_am_tanaya_biswas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144163081447736, "text": "Do it in reverse tho maybe she’s just seeing the change and being like wow it does look dif. This is a shitty experiment.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:53:13", "owner": "thirtysucks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087574828955741, "text": "Ta igual", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:24:01", "owner": "pizza_romana_crocanube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293925721277287, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:08:00", "owner": "matt_hoover05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049993802398671, "text": "The whitest person on earth, “so I really am a pastel person?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:49:20", "owner": "jonrdzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159491872392122, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:25:22", "owner": "6fatiq._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922128520186750, "text": "The true spring seems very overwhelming on her soft features. With light spring I’m immediately looking at her pretty eyes and face!", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:23:13", "owner": "lola.lovespell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070065275376137, "text": "Light spring completely washes her out??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:16:19", "owner": "borrowedfromthewboro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094954084863315, "text": ".olo", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:49:33", "owner": "rupsaa_rup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929427106140000, "text": "I see no difference 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:09:53", "owner": "skittyblossom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051187154346575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:43:02", "owner": "suavvvecitoo_1up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045565445466178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:42:44", "owner": "suavvvecitoo_1up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423678478118960, "text": "Woah a white girl likes pastels?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:41:42", "owner": "bumari_831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104566510637086, "text": "And girls make fun of mens hobbies", "created_at": "2025-11