r people ? Seriously question", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:46:53", "owner": "p.escobarjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918491758206213, "text": "Where did you get those color collars?!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:03:51", "owner": "laurenmcgeebeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986982963863082, "text": "Why would I need this if I only wear black, gray and white", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:04:07", "owner": "alrightbuddythatsenough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887867521263986, "text": "Gorgeous light spring❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:18:18", "owner": "elizabeth_ellen7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865406509502646, "text": "@innamoll", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:23:08", "owner": "coni_rlabarthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099409270779899, "text": "Do this w me", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:34:12", "owner": "brandonabra_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521721700067230, "text": "So beautiful 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:29:35", "owner": "miss_healthy_food", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866861815482999, "text": "She looks better in dark springs", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:37:52", "owner": "hairzrococo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097002505829647, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:55:14", "owner": "nadia_ok4917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088479725069977, "text": "Can you recommend someone in the philly area?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:33:12", "owner": "lindsaysellsnj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116092912563214, "text": "All is same 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:26:54", "owner": "adham.hagag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860821528468519, "text": "I like first 🧐 bright colors complement her face", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:47:51", "owner": "khomich_oks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136123456460900, "text": "Thank you for nothing, algorithm 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:13:12", "owner": "taylorsedd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091126648928884, "text": "Ro", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:47:37", "owner": "milizasmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860724880540992, "text": "I need to know mine lmao", "creat