6:27:44", "owner": "vendetta_05666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028023848757935, "text": "Stop this", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:59:42", "owner": "romakkav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124625890516809, "text": "Wow I need the pallets for my clients😮", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:40:27", "owner": "dafnasaffer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902765743297839, "text": "I’d be so disappointed to learn I’m built for bland middle-of-the-road nothingy colours.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:30:03", "owner": "yes_dancollins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844627429613700, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:06:25", "owner": "muse.ryan.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140991805453100, "text": "before - befive", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:30:30", "owner": "bilel__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066613481454417, "text": "We all know she is pink", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:15:12", "owner": "arturo_rabago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058302866265058, "text": "I mean duh", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:28:33", "owner": "1901a2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986293845877225, "text": "Past-EL", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:21:46", "owner": "funkietees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397366117125800, "text": "Wtf is this rage bait?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:43:46", "owner": "bl0ckchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881594224307297, "text": "Ok if she puts all them clown colors....of course. ..it was like 5 different oranges right there... Flip them over and once says for blacks and the other says for whites.,. This is dum", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:40:07", "owner": "luvmilukilife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126637546448499, "text": "Why did my algorithm bring me here?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:34:31", "owner": "jesse_panda_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925518589168138, "text": "Women do the dumbest shlt", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:51:51", "owner": "jared_garcia4801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544448302018348, "text": "Ole musical face when the fades came on deck.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:34:49", "owner": "thotcreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102202153668801, "text": "Was anyone else tripped out and thought it was a floating head for the first 3 seconds", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:52:42", "owner": "noelepadilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150143812424798, "text": "Thought I was gonna be the only one who thought she looked more pale in light spring.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:28:38", "owner": "cdog.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162928183380101, "text": "Immediately adds “pastel person, light spring” into her bio on EVERYTHING", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:23:54", "owner": "nuttrbuttrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914599606229780, "text": "I’m an asparagus", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:31:51", "owner": "mdeleo94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061252394208561, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:25:41", "owner": "areyesff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428113579109952, "text": "lol i wonder who won’t be a light spring 🤣 i think everyone will look beter with that..", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:40:40", "owner": "dalomonnier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035677682710152, "text": "Fuck my life i dont see it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:51:42", "owner": "hesse_lebt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010393397643180, "text": "Wtf are they doing", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:45:32", "owner": "denniz_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953945620012847, "text": "What’s the difference", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:43:41", "owner": "joedaniels710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856813951505284, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:09:29", "owner": "3manueljosue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887736961266139, "text": "Love this but also I was scrolling by and was like damn that's the most intense guitar hero song 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:38:36", "owner": "khadrimx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907815679270253, "text": "Yall gullible asf💀", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:26:46", "owner": "rich__life95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198509275323305, "text": "so am i a black spring? dark shit? idontknow", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:06:56", "owner": "good.omenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851523748546833, "text": "Fake! It’s the cameras color sensor technology not able to simulate life like colors. Rendering a full frame photo or video inaccurately. Compensates exposure and temperature based on majority of colors being represented to the camera. \n-\nHumans need to stop lying to themselves and learn the hardware they use.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:03:15", "owner": "exklim_ceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906644038270059, "text": "Is it normal that i don't understand any of this...", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:43:34", "owner": "maxkane24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932172834998083, "text": "I prefer the other one", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:49:24", "owner": "liaphughes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090376981912083, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:08:37", "owner": "dumitru_rm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936214891096053, "text": "What changed", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:24:26", "owner": "eddgardiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297553222281726, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:52:22", "owner": "slabua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078147724912047, "text": "No the first one was better", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:29:25", "owner": "jackrileyosborne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932000641110675, "text": "She’s definitely a true spring", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:58:36", "owner": "pwayko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062362895450566, "text": "What happened?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:10:43", "owner": "tactical_sharts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930429793138179, "text": "Im in the wrong area again🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:05:02", "owner": "venderosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133694110468901, "text": "Is it me or is  she color blind 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:49:03", "owner": "revix_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102815995589631, "text": "Pas tal person", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:26:53", "owner": "bytarang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320338759173971, "text": "Kitna me hota hai ye sb didi karvana tha mrko bhi 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:14:28", "owner": "_being_aadi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093544321686789, "text": "dude", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:52:45", "owner": "wil_avalon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086064128493791, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:50:51", "owner": "ykay81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050152811670224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:08:07", "owner": "4da__moment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072453818199384, "text": "Idk how to know the difference?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:14:05", "owner": "leijeefine_manalay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079708220145665, "text": "I think she looks more like a Summer, but not Light Summer.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:52:25", "owner": "esussie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968203365828106, "text": "Looks like Summer and Spring colors mixed in that palette ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:51:12", "owner": "esussie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185556361350641, "text": "Camera auto exposer", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:41:40", "owner": "ravis_hankar1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098790196813019, "text": "Cover half of the screen so you can’t see the palette. You won’t see any difference, neither in reflected light nor face or hair.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:34:21", "owner": "freeridenz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942548812072674, "text": "Seems like bs", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:52:22", "owner": "davidsonjustin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049103066392291, "text": "If she changes her hair color, would she still be light spring? Genuinely curious. 🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:48:24", "owner": "admiral_alex23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101258536668909, "text": "The shadows on her face got so much brighter! People say she looks pale, but it is that she looks lighter. Less contrast. Less shadows..", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:43:20", "owner": "sjay_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122441815525789, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:40:59", "owner": "officer.nate.higgers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986933025748004, "text": "I have such a hard time seeing the difference in these videos is it only me 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:57:00", "owner": "shyanneevelynemary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162624568388599, "text": "Don't say dude...", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:49:47", "owner": "brendanpottage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494570614074534, "text": "Jajajajaja one off the worst scams ever. Pople need to learn about white balance on digital cameras 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:33:13", "owner": "marcos_corea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410303917139656, "text": "As a ginger I so badly want to do this😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:44:25", "owner": "snakez2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911369275253759, "text": "\"RGB vs CMYK\"  ahh designer moment", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:39:35", "owner": "m.korayem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086577911058423, "text": "So I already can tell every guy in here has no clue what’s going on, well, neither do I", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:51:40", "owner": "boazeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395404387135317, "text": "1st one is giving circus tent. 2nd one is giving princess ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:40:42", "owner": "wuthering_kc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063028946178991, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:10:17", "owner": "72hourwins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919729129192412, "text": "Wear whatever you want! Don’t base your wardrobe on some random opinion (that tends to make people look pale) and wear what makes you happiest! I’ve seen so many people upset by the results because they liked one color scheme that a ‘specialist’ told them looked terrible in.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:58:07", "owner": "hhwriting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176921200365896, "text": "I love color theory", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:56:49", "owner": "shini.bubble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099084550786235, "text": "I keep seeing these and I can never see a difference", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:33:26", "owner": "azswim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117337963490118, "text": "Clown 🤡 colors or not", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:29:30", "owner": "ericburtondds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914210941229491, "text": "I don’t know how I ended up here, but could you help explain? I don’t understand what I’m seeing.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:26:46", "owner": "coolbreeze3o3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171728035328832, "text": "Mudo porra nenhuma", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:11:50", "owner": "khaoskt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416571406140471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:49:17", "owner": "migue_cannon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007339436654975, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:23:40", "owner": "sp.nyhet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289089832302505, "text": "I see no difference", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:13:18", "owner": "emmanuel_rumani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864393187513532, "text": "This all depends on what type of light you have. If you have a fluorescent light it's different if you have tungsten light, it's different. The light bulb or the sunlight is the most important", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:45:42", "owner": "silvertons_child", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999017373691272, "text": "The both look like dumb bibs", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:31:47", "owner": "woodey1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049599059384700, "text": "she looks so pale I swear, I think the first one add more color to her face 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:24:14", "owner": "louxlhc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925191172158290, "text": "Washed-out palet ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:39:12", "owner": "yourdutch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075047867259846, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:58:48", "owner": "antg_fosho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290721004276983, "text": "I’m deep autumn", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:54:13", "owner": "tre_brenda_jackson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183023245347480, "text": "Wym that look so bad", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:23:35", "owner": "sto_riesdaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439557241096209, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:20:39", "owner": "manxi901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970706916813968, "text": "These things literally make no sense to me. That and the gold silver shit. What are we looking at? What is changing other then holding up vibrant colors vs muted?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:46:20", "owner": "dominic.907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913026832098145, "text": "What exactly is this for?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:45:27", "owner": "thomke.wi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932059012076223, "text": "I think it’s an opinion", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:02:58", "owner": "pbstars22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350556664202369, "text": "definitely light spring!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:56:04", "owner": "_allison.bellamy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087553876770755, "text": "I usually do but here I don't see any lighting difference", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:26:02", "owner": "e.1h4n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306469261264473, "text": "Guys stop being stupid that's not true thing", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:07:22", "owner": "heknow.78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073064579022710, "text": "What a load of shite.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:34:40", "owner": "craighunter6", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["coloranalysis", "undertone", "beauty", "makeup", "haircolor", "fashion", "colorconsultant", "miamibeach", "lightspring"]},
{"media_id": 3772937715911405471, "shortcode": "DRcKtzckq-f", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRcKtzckq-f/", "taken_at": "2025-11-24T13:07:54", "caption": "終於打開了🤣\n.\n#防潮箱 #開鎖 #日常\n#搞笑 #阿任日常", "owner_username": "_ren.chen", "owner_id": "331052439", "likes": 20112, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0028_DRcKtzckq-f\\DRcKtzckq-f_20251124_130754.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18179060851317688, "text": "結果阿伯有收錢嗎哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:29:38", "owner": "lunlun_603", "likes": 68}, {"id": 18133843216430961, "text": "我幫你做安全玻璃呀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:27:30", "owner": "996long_f11", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18099710440685874, "text": "靠北～師傅你真的會開鎖嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:47:38", "owner": "594duoduo", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18046739933456383, "text": "其實這樣老闆也只可以自己開😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:17:08", "owner": "man__1120", "likes": 1255}, {"id": 18076605743465690, "text": "真的笑死那個沈默的瞬間", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:26:21", "owner": "doolweng", "likes": 152}, {"id": 18087945247982489, "text": "這故事告訴我們，不管做什麼都要錄影，一個意外就成了素材😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:58:03", "owner": "sucheng.03", "likes": 694}, {"id": 18098668525811178, "text": "情緒穩定😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:52:15", "owner": "ocmemetina", "likes": 59}, {"id": 17873259471455448, "text": "這個我會", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:11:34", "owner": "blacks0509", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18544081741035111, "text": "好在你這麼樂觀，師傅心想唉呀⋯\n係啊 要賠錢", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:39:08", "owner": "09_fu03", "likes": 370}, {"id": 18062194553562647, "text": "沒看過這麼樂觀的😂他可能還想說完蛋了要賠錢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:05:13", "owner": "weiting_0954", "likes": 383}, {"id": 17969276174824962, "text": "在訂做一塊新玻璃 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:12:53", "owner": "laiyu1998_2727", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18117705526548257, "text": "😂處處有笑點", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:48:51", "owner": "kaisheng__0511", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17962803239862960, "text": "心態真好🙌\n讚讚", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:55:44", "owner": "honggi333", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18099768721783185, "text": "好有趣的一集", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:22:13", "owner": "peter___8151", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17866684227501144, "text": "安餒各欸防潮嗎🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:34:47", "owner": "c_______________________77", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085615807950394, "text": "人生就是這樣 處處充滿驚喜", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:17:29", "owner": "li_168957", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18037643954710262, "text": "你就說是不是打開了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:03:40", "owner": "hcj0205", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18173862094370746, "text": "乾我笑死😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:36:08", "owner": "orang6e", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18035969372722781, "text": "其實跟防潮箱的客服講就會寄來給你了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:16:12", "owner": "cheng_charley", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17924126004191185, "text": "這集成本有點高", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:33:56", "owner": "chen_228", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18050388485665128, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:38:28", "owner": "hkts_kai_8131", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987331875749057, "text": "笑這笑著眼淚就流下來了～", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:40:25", "owner": "maisgarage71", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094444069856644, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:40:45", "owner": "hank_6683", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109801714720807, "text": "笑死XDDD 好樂觀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:10:09", "owner": "wei_._0301", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868547347412598, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:33:35", "owner": "g654638", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965423118842925, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:26:52", "owner": "wie1060222", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18512777239069662, "text": "好多相機", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:09:41", "owner": "ian._.0712", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079761980276139, "text": "乾你要找我啊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:34:42", "owner": "vrs245_z", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105173323648705, "text": "下次購入防潮箱要再多一個功能\n是防爆 防爆玻璃", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:23:32", "owner": "lsy622_jason", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18175756903369069, "text": "我有遇過  後來查網路\n右下角螺絲拆下來\n整片門就下來了\n鎖頭有編號 可以跟原廠購買鑰匙", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:04:34", "owner": "wertyui0411", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17989589492903088, "text": "阿伯敲破的瞬間在想哇今天錢要飛走了🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:20:22", "owner": "tt_.5.2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17986532237751165, "text": "好奇這樣阿伯有錢收嗎？還是要賠錢！？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:00:50", "owner": "qq1635", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18541122325043350, "text": "可以拿回原廠修玻璃吧⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:36:24", "owner": "king5div", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095083615887539, "text": "不潮不用錢💰（林俊傑）", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:14:52", "owner": "quan_07.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184855363348411, "text": "早知道自己來就好🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:14:47", "owner": "feather2379", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989142279883742, "text": "這不是跟原廠買鑰匙就好嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:15:31", "owner": "shin740309", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071152529524939, "text": "阿北表示 ： 早說嘛～ 前面就不用搞得這麼麻煩😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:24:04", "owner": "blackcode1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083033024042830, "text": "玩相機10幾年，防潮箱從沒鎖過，在家裡用不到鎖，遇小偷他整箱搬走就好", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:16:54", "owner": "mingxueyou", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057535088306026, "text": "這台不是要三四千", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:38:42", "owner": "hankchang33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104851327653917, "text": "最後還是敲下去", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:20:00", "owner": "yishao.1997", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093653911895486, "text": "帥喔", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:17:52", "owner": "blacktea099", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895228030367428, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:51:49", "owner": "a0935807763", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848541637593487, "text": "幹超好笑 笑到流眼淚", "created_at": "2025-12-19T08:21:24", "owner": "jia07di", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121268581544097, "text": "原廠鑰匙🔑150，我剛買完", "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:27:19", "owner": "jiggo0115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082296518136344, "text": "哈哈哈哈 太可愛", "created_at": "2025-12-16T13:46:06", "owner": "jamieyyyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059040401638447, "text": "下次找我，免费！！！！", "created_at": "2025-12-16T11:34:26", "owner": "khaiwen123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060141836283223, "text": "沒想到收藏家的鑰匙會那麼難開 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-16T10:45:00", "owner": "7herkqs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106561648641452, "text": "不知道玻璃門是否可以重新訂做一個", "created_at": "2025-12-16T08:48:14", "owner": "usn.yao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001455947834178, "text": "先買一個新的，同廠牌鑰匙應該是共用的", "created_at": "2025-12-16T07:31:49", "owner": "zhnchnchn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975436335959808, "text": "早知道是這樣開 倒不如自己開？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T14:42:27", "owner": "shin_6210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927009172186881, "text": "哈💰-哈💰-哈💰-哈💰-哈💰", "created_at": "2025-12-15T11:47:51", "owner": "yucheng_890316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167806987391453, "text": "可以拿來做甕仔雞了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T15:47:14", "owner": "fujieowo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085320229841209, "text": "這樣當初自己開就好了##😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T09:45:43", "owner": "u333689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921720994204689, "text": "原來防潮箱 玻璃那麼脆弱", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:48:00", "owner": "ws860000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079105949227136, "text": "防潮不防爆", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:59:36", "owner": "linenzhenglin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385869964196386, "text": "@a860610", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:25:26", "owner": "ghost_ling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027421196583316, "text": "底下應該有螺絲可以拆開", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:37:39", "owner": "kelrsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090282208764224, "text": "我還以為阿伯是故意弄破的...", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:36:58", "owner": "leon61015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087056132054649, "text": "不能詢問防潮箱廠商如何處理嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:48:31", "owner": "ms.orange_cosmos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084220085514245, "text": "其實玻璃可以換壓克力板，就不會有玻璃的危險，可惜你已經給回收阿姨了，不然因該可以在使用，但也需要給開鎖的師父一些時間，畢竟不是每種鎖都好開，破壞的方式在開鎖其實有點危險。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:54:54", "owner": "jing__79160.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931237621138515, "text": "感覺師父的那聲 好  是發出內心的開心（可以拆嚕～", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:32:05", "owner": "you.tw.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844509565630542, "text": "@92_yichen  某。希望我們家的不用這樣開😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:19:17", "owner": "haoshenglai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046584344480505, "text": "一支螺絲批就可以", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:16:55", "owner": "tkoalbert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843573478624481, "text": "老闆說我只是照你的話做🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:42:35", "owner": "afz150501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950656021051455, "text": "瞬間變 置物櫃", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:07:34", "owner": "yangjustin9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088678825814137, "text": "我用很小的一字起子就可以打開了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:37:52", "owner": "ddt_lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869488375410117, "text": "玻璃敲碎打開請鎖匠幹嘛⋯⋯🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:05:14", "owner": "easonchiang9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412044364190632, "text": "可以繼續當普通櫃子用啊🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:32:02", "owner": "minchengmimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931404553114596, "text": "收錢嗎？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:48:07", "owner": "william_hkyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056626949319185, "text": "其實這個好像同款鑰匙都一樣 可以上網求救借鑰匙", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:33:32", "owner": "clauclautw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302610835248355, "text": "好樂觀🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:42:25", "owner": "s688909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118756597557192, "text": "那個...防潮箱上面有個號碼，跟廠商聯絡可以買鑰匙", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:18:47", "owner": "leonhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868228693483601, "text": "這個有需要鎖起來 我都關起來", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:29:08", "owner": "jamesyu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119730445533336, "text": "防潮箱廠商都有備用鑰匙可以買", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:56:28", "owner": "raymond.c_0613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968188288002798, "text": "會不會問廠商他們有鑰匙可能他們有幾個模板可以看序號或什麼可以找到鑰匙", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:54:50", "owner": "lhyuan_ph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080032952469459, "text": "哈哈 開啟成功 舒服", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:11:42", "owner": "chiangenchuang710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985871970924301, "text": "如果是收藏家，你只要拍鑰匙孔的地方，給收藏家，就可以買一副鑰匙了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:37:55", "owner": "eh_bubu0925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098430544701882, "text": "玩攝影的防潮箱應該是算便宜的🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:28:34", "owner": "linzhiquiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936956295980346, "text": "樓主樂觀給respect", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:55:04", "owner": "cckzero3769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068489903379106, "text": "好像用一字硬轉就可以打開", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:01:18", "owner": "gin_vogue168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074656190262317, "text": "為什麼不找原廠問問看🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:48:29", "owner": "s.yuzhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147100546391571, "text": "這個用剪刀用一用就好了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:25:21", "owner": "yian._.0303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066110306145864, "text": "有mavic一代ㄟ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:23", "owner": "zprrz8942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068880929378652, "text": "不早說，可以請我來開啊", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:16", "owner": "cjcdjw2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159617869363258, "text": "玻璃敲碎自己來就可以了，", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:44", "owner": "up_emperor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156379510406179, "text": "我以為這樣問是老闆知道會壞掉沒想到是意外啊😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:19", "owner": "ztr0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884769811406619, "text": "太好笑了🤣 但謝謝你用幽默化解阿伯的尷尬👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:22:27", "owner": "pakoooo_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492201538079978, "text": "這心態很棒，給個讚🤣 老闆當下大概很怕吧😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:27:27", "owner": "puremilktea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299186494281071, "text": "這個心態也太穩了👍給個讚🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:53", "owner": "oscarmk53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169419277342032, "text": "敢收工錢嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:16:32", "owner": "chan808yuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080868020153973, "text": "手術成功病人死亡😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:29:12", "owner": "xstherwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077406707469532, "text": "上新聞", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:08:23", "owner": "jie._129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991692717894088, "text": "網路上有賣解鎖工具唷⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:28:59", "owner": "mickeyhsupo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895791493352635, "text": "可以直接當櫃子用", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:09:44", "owner": "yrr1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064901522156145, "text": "開心就好", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:20:29", "owner": "hank32308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067566635617960, "text": "哇～破掉了😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:58:21", "owner": "cash.tzou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868379983495781, "text": "這用一字起子就所以把鎖轉開", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:30:14", "owner": "chungchengshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082309892028737, "text": "要這樣 自己砸破就好 阿北的反應很真實", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:15:57", "owner": "linshengping0505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879456772332875, "text": "師傅會不會開鎖我不知道，但是很會開箱，哈哈哈！", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:38:46", "owner": "ray_01.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878218111429448, "text": "有付出勤➕開鎖費嗎🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:08:45", "owner": "ka912308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061284884220835, "text": "個性我喜歡🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:21:32", "owner": "chengtsunbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321577615169760, "text": "靠夭  似乎你自己就能敲破了😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:56:48", "owner": "g24911305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100254784775811, "text": "啊北做效果做很滿", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:48", "owner": "david55688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103592824664489, "text": "人在無語真的會笑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:29:49", "owner": "wendy__0509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951323479025279, "text": "要這樣開 需要找他來嗎🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:56:39", "owner": "mr.rick666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103929289644827, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:16:33", "owner": "zhenbangy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087212818985343, "text": "他把玻璃打破的瞬間，想哭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:09:13", "owner": "sanyo_.1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155546017408478, "text": "其實沒差，因為相機比較貴", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:08:32", "owner": "sanyo_.1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057808106289263, "text": "情緒好穩定，這個要向你學習🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:01:12", "owner": "d.xi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066656777111978, "text": "這箱子我們家也有一個，但是都沒在用", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:35:25", "owner": "kiwi6_281", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996949140705718, "text": "最後有收錢嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:34:31", "owner": "ast4325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106506475616644, "text": "只能開心的苦笑😅", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:25:00", "owner": "janest.04.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122361217524040, "text": "這個好笑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:56:53", "owner": "try8153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065328203147737, "text": "這⋯拿剪刀其中一端插進去轉就開了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:50:19", "owner": "isj31_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892400335364864, "text": "鎖頭可以換新鎖", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:50:06", "owner": "enzehuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082595480089496, "text": "頭腦簡單敲當然破😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:35:01", "owner": "abc316881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358250008163190, "text": "好潮的防潮箱", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:11:11", "owner": "qimian__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902409685166818, "text": "我笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:12:53", "owner": "li.zong_qi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917411692233243, "text": "好樂觀的人喔", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:57:22", "owner": "hsuan1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061454066210462, "text": "結果收多少錢？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:51:58", "owner": "s28261969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117628021491545, "text": "Haha😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:51:26", "owner": "choichoibike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059235416259297, "text": "防潮箱後面的主機板上有螺絲，拆開就直接可以伸手進去😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:33:26", "owner": "kung.jason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919245763198035, "text": "电钻钻锁头就好了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:08:23", "owner": "ixesiew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059130197256927, "text": "那個腳沒事吧？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:06:52", "owner": "ys._.1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087986521783122, "text": "你就說開沒開", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:58:19", "owner": "a6887796114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085148867009121, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:36:22", "owner": "1275_79kdf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411360931187878, "text": "鎖要改成指紋了😂指紋不會被弄不見😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:16:14", "owner": "a3373611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066955817617542, "text": "你就說是不是開了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:42:35", "owner": "ftn_94005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048470765412266, "text": "這上面有編號可以直接跟原廠買鑰匙說", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:38:28", "owner": "kangpopo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083144504043151, "text": "變防“嘲”箱了！😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:31:27", "owner": "js0938", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872177704461740, "text": "我來就好😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:25:37", "owner": "milkliu222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139375618459737, "text": "其實我也發生過一樣的事情，但我用一把螺絲起子轉開螺絲就開了，我跟你一樣是同牌子的", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:23:08", "owner": "s605071227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097704430634639, "text": "阿伯破的那一秒嚇死了 還好你不計較 心態超好的 讚🤜🤛", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:02:38", "owner": "twasd80602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086515246958167, "text": "剛好換壓克力呀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:19:17", "owner": "kevin6071212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074752280214957, "text": "那個鎖…很好開啊", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:42:12", "owner": "lonelywindwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985740891756256, "text": "下次找我 這我會🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:31:02", "owner": "0505_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072424640338240, "text": "👏👏 真的打開了 不可思議 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:09:10", "owner": "min.yang368", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037253858707049, "text": "可能他後面就打開了哈哈結果你一句狠人", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:01:10", "owner": "cai_19991225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297287416283209, "text": "我也都找他弄鑰匙🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:53:20", "owner": "dong__8535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005485514668885, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:51:59", "owner": "danielnan999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867158284489147, "text": "心態好讚", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:40:22", "owner": "_.kuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089210035764486, "text": "要開到箱咁自己打爆佢就得", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:13:18", "owner": "klein_chan_mix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947849386061084, "text": "最快方法..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:06:58", "owner": "lingfansu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103385080672959, "text": "馬洗虧阿😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:48:05", "owner": "kaivr46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396380905121177, "text": "確實打開了🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:43:36", "owner": "hengs_dreamworkshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320703535175655, "text": "無言的時候真的會笑出來", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:41:45", "owner": "fyk_1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098368918813981, "text": "認真問，這種防潮箱不是防盜箱啊，真的會很難開鎖嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:31:37", "owner": "teung_yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078957412930921, "text": "😮😮😮我自己敲就好了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:19:14", "owner": "qop_1240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378966655151020, "text": "@meet060881 尬爆", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:45:20", "owner": "xaio_o108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879579535430340, "text": "那幹麻找阿伯…自已來就好了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:18:25", "owner": "dennisdd0911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081657851282774, "text": "我家的防潮箱，我用剪刀就開了🤣\n連著鎖一起轉開的鎖沒開但門開", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:14:48", "owner": "wuzimiao0317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102883294661363, "text": "我知道你其實想換新的，對不對？！", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:59:36", "owner": "lukeshih123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873630580450123, "text": "這技術……又不是保險箱😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:27:47", "owner": "mao_shiang_yeou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086146727078069, "text": "辣個眼神👀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:17:30", "owner": "gtr262", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086533495996224, "text": "ok啦 喜得一個鐵櫃 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:52:59", "owner": "yuqi27__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429671596128304, "text": "阿伯緊張死了 哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:22:09", "owner": "oo___ching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896916928201513, "text": "忘記跟老闆說，還要能關😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:15:45", "owner": "kent12.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891326557242067, "text": "有夠兩光", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:15:38", "owner": "jerry_shan177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914360482094842, "text": "這種直接跟原廠買鑰匙就好了，鎖頭上面有數字", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:14:46", "owner": "jerry_shan177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111724450580350, "text": "阿北的沈默震耳欲聾", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:19:33", "owner": "tattoo_99999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976924233791868, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:08:49", "owner": "wu_.0323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539682991028236, "text": "老闆解鎖另一種成就🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:32:32", "owner": "kai._127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059181416272855, "text": "原來我就是開鎖的 直接敲破", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:26:00", "owner": "kwc0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103125583673876, "text": "硬啦就開了，鎖的舌片就是一塊薄薄的鐵😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:32:17", "owner": "johnny_yitai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096132757660813, "text": "後來老闆有收開鎖錢嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:41:01", "owner": "lalasnowbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212864815309027, "text": "阿伯：挫賽啊..破料料😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:00:16", "owner": "yo.66__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070280210369910, "text": "再重買一咖", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:40:47", "owner": "y_a_n_0_3_2_8_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048138800410807, "text": "對看的那一瞬間有點可愛🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:32:22", "owner": "qing__.7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18232004872306979, "text": "還好妳沒拿到好市多櫃檯跟他說 \n我要退貨😂 原因太難開了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:51:52", "owner": "mix.max.why", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339258232239678, "text": "其實用力拉櫃門就會開了 鎖只有一小片金屬扣在箱體上 等他變形門就會開了 再拿螺絲起子把鎖換新的就好", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:28:55", "owner": "r_jen2333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085831853483751, "text": "他的門是鎖螺絲的", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:18:09", "owner": "9703_04.su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061116809233571, "text": "下次買防潮箱不鎖的話，要拿熱熔膠先填上😆", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:15:27", "owner": "howard_0115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916471147229443, "text": "玻璃可以重做", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:39:00", "owner": "cw_1207_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067993913101769, "text": "這在鬧嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:46:40", "owner": "joshlovesupreme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086915968815274, "text": "可以放東西在裡面😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:24:17", "owner": "mahiru_edd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009247538653256, "text": "靠邀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:00:20", "owner": "qldmillmerran", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["防潮箱", "開鎖", "日常", "搞笑", "阿任日常"]},
{"media_id": 3784252108146208627, "shortcode": "DSEXT4Wk-9z", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSEXT4Wk-9z/", "taken_at": "2025-12-10T03:41:20", "caption": "#chiikawa #吉伊卡哇 #ちいかわ #chiikawaland #なんか小さくてかわいいやつ #ハチワレ #うさぎ #モモンガ #chikawa", "owner_username": "chiikawa_usagiiii", "owner_id": "64695403783", "likes": 8940, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0029_DSEXT4Wk-9z\\DSEXT4Wk-9z_20251210_034120.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18103215013687999, "text": "第一名應該是：一個億非非非非非非常好賺女孩", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:47:18", "owner": "asdtfgt_0998787", "likes": 1520}, {"id": 17984705474764004, "text": "第一名一定是清華大學的學生", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:15:27", "owner": "kholian_ryugakusei", "likes": 589}, {"id": 17926795824036898, "text": "时代峰峻三秒1亿", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:53:36", "owner": "yxixi915", "likes": 80}, {"id": 17980743128929320, "text": "是不是沒有台積電，我剛剛查，只需要幾分鐘到半小時😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:39:17", "owner": "kimmy50303", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18162897178395398, "text": "我以為最後一個是太子集團😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:56:42", "owner": "oujimi", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17919126990216223, "text": "一個億非非非非飛飛杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯杯非常容易賺到", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:27:40", "owner": "lubingchenlu", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18067199198626415, "text": "不是我看老半天在等烏薩奇", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:50:17", "owner": "ocean.prophetai", "likes": 182}, {"id": 17842849497652447, "text": "我選清華大學", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:33:56", "owner": "sydney_w27", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17938181601108930, "text": "李飞：轻轻松松，一个亿，拿下", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:43:52", "owner": "kaiyee0419", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17879790690434284, "text": "台積電1小時耶", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:17:09", "owner": "tangtangellayingci", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080375524917980, "text": "怎麼有吳京啦", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:30:57", "owner": "jiangzhongyang55", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053473307678286, "text": "我選清華大學", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:41:11", "owner": "abrahamchen.abe", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18085959170082151, "text": "普通人😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:07:05", "owner": "havord28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042514973704238, "text": "一個億非非非非常容易可以賺到的", "created_at": "2025-12-14T16:33:05", "owner": "_82pannn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070378892598403, "text": "哪个货币的亿😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:33:31", "owner": "wanwuzongjiangdiaoling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061385477247994, "text": "中川他爸只要一秒", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:17:26", "owner": "weizhi569", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140943040454664, "text": "太弱了！我們館長三分鐘四億啦", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:39:07", "owner": "osiris0223", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18047679719694204, "text": "我就問這個音樂要多爛", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:57:49", "owner": "bvaky_1221", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18086619482037003, "text": "当我看到罗永浩赚的比董明珠多的时候，这个榜单已经可以不用看了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:00:47", "owner": "lujiahao86", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976752018959985, "text": "普通人賺2000年，已經變咗做霍金😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:37:48", "owner": "hibro6628", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077220182192351, "text": "😂😎No.1", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:03:09", "owner": "chiikawa_usagiiii", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18189017410339379, "text": "我還以為冠軍是臺積電", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:50:14", "owner": "z9010021043049512008", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18150881047421304, "text": "你不理解 一個億非非非非非非非非非非非非常容易賺到", "created_at": "2025-12-14T12:11:21", "owner": "cicx1000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067854881430121, "text": "脚踏实地最后要的，不要不切实际去想那些不三不四的东西而走上不规路！", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:06:52", "owner": "ngenttat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128951776496232, "text": "习总若是要赚一个亿 ，Anytime 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:11:45", "owner": "vctlvc4088", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854751526584029, "text": "我以为乌萨奇一分钟一个亿🥹🥹😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:01:50", "owner": "xxyxxbgdinggd", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18148538932384381, "text": "我在等馬斯克", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:17:22", "owner": "shri.mp0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055667555653591, "text": "這音樂比我月經還亂", "created_at": "2025-12-18T03:54:05", "owner": "_xny8uu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091531714943111, "text": "怎麼沒有三星品牌", "created_at": "2025-12-17T08:44:37", "owner": "fuyi_.0120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094835176920872, "text": "nvidia?", "created_at": "2025-12-15T15:46:44", "owner": "no_n_ggers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089104349051645, "text": "智障，C朗一個億要多久？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:39:58", "owner": "chp10627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101009920747713, "text": "马斯克：我呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-15T01:02:04", "owner": "fuyusheng9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086261906319120, "text": "買彩票照理來說可以一秒一個億", "created_at": "2025-12-14T11:19:41", "owner": "hefeng_zy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873434191467402, "text": "第一不应该是时代峰峻吗？😂三分钟就能赚一个亿😢", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:58:54", "owner": "coco_khexuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912106675253325, "text": "台積電呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:49:00", "owner": "zhangyousheng76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966504207847605, "text": "不就2000年", "created_at": "2025-12-14T07:23:56", "owner": "eliotlch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097504294677163, "text": "真是人比人氣死人", "created_at": "2025-12-14T05:33:40", "owner": "yangyuanfangyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146808970443765, "text": "诈骗集团分分钟上亿🤣比个毛啊tm还不如摆烂好 只要够懒就没人能骗的了你", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:09:37", "owner": "chuxuehen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120465322558750, "text": "要考清华的那小女孩呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:38:49", "owner": "der_der_derderder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927104998178429, "text": "台積電：❓", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:42:51", "owner": "owen_tsai0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906795439144161, "text": "亞馬遜排第2 那第一不用說一定是沃爾瑪", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:14:55", "owner": "chenjunxun23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337564303239794, "text": "第一名應該是時代峰峻，只要3秒", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:19:25", "owner": "cjm_0811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898479316201456, "text": "😂我是从后面数回头第一名非我莫属也！", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:08:46", "owner": "ivysoongsewmei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104357515663463, "text": "👍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:52:45", "owner": "sky.tok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842196943658181, "text": "班长呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:10:30", "owner": "fnsmile321_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103364650665599, "text": "吴京那么厉害？", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:22:27", "owner": "pinchuanchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097251556847481, "text": "台積電只要30~40分鐘🙂‍↕️🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:01:24", "owner": "hippo_potamus._.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302765449281209, "text": "Google怎麼轉", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:40:30", "owner": "johnn.y6067", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083460731031843, "text": "這到底是什麼狗屁排名", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:39:18", "owner": "zhou_jr.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431025370107985, "text": "你好像忘記世界巨頭 台積電 英偉達", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:18:47", "owner": "tony50103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383227096148050, "text": "可以念力讓你一秒損失超過一億😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:45:59", "owner": "muserun1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031715303758167, "text": "习近平", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:21:34", "owner": "haoyangkuek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971695935992424, "text": "那權志龍呢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:41:08", "owner": "tyresemfdoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332205685242952, "text": "銀行印鈔才是第一名", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:25:09", "owner": "michaelbowen8999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151113907424111, "text": "中國共慘黨的影片 看看笑笑即可  垃圾影片 怎不說共慘黨詐騙世界 秒賺億元 垃圾中國", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:16:13", "owner": "chihliangjao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099047254836437, "text": "什麼貸幣單位？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:56:26", "owner": "wai_wai_0708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414188539139615, "text": "沙特阿美 你缺那40分钟嘛👉🏾👈🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:07:45", "owner": "ruinek_blyat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974218410809159, "text": "你不要想錢你活到2000年再說", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:20:41", "owner": "cwf._.vcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931040485119320, "text": "普通人：你覺得我能活到那麼長嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:17:46", "owner": "cwf._.vcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843393484637680, "text": "茅台都是赚给黄牛吧", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:56:12", "owner": "davidjunweihe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085055234286686, "text": "蘋果不是庫克的嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:05:44", "owner": "omg_omg_wiexin_is_so_handsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375075637159972, "text": "居然沒有nvidia或黃仁勳？ 我以為其中一個會是第一名", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:30:51", "owner": "tomb8526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107163037634272, "text": "健保一針一億", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:54:06", "owner": "hank41772752", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426729481119061, "text": "@183956_.02 吹吹吹吹吹吹吹牛逼呢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:56:18", "owner": "cch_nitezx1030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022256708790088, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:06:00", "owner": "nnick20120105", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["chiikawa", "吉伊卡哇", "ちいかわ", "chiikawaland", "なんか小さくてかわいいやつ", "ハチワレ", "うさぎ", "モモンガ", "chikawa"]}